    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730175
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730176
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730177
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Here, take a look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730178
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730179
    m_Localized: 'Luka: I wonder if a person''s teeth says a lot about them?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730180
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730181
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730182
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730183
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730184
    m_Localized: 'Luka: My own two hands... Still got them, even after everything else I''ve lost!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730185
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730186
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730187
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Of course.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730188
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730189
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Eyes remember a lot.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730190
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730191
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730192
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Didn''t know that mattered too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730193
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730194
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Looks pretty ordinary, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730195
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730196
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730197
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Alrighty!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730198
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730199
    m_Localized: 'Luka: One more thing that''ll remain after I''m gone. If only there was anyone left to remember us.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730200
    m_Localized: 'Luka: One more thing that''ll remain after I''m gone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730201
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730202
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730203
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Our voices are lost in the void of the universe.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730204
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730205
    m_Localized: 'Luka: But I''m always ready to listen to you!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730206
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Alrighty!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730207
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730208
    m_Localized: 'Luka: I''m always ready to listen to you!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730209
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730210
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730211
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Everything''s easier with a gun, isn''t it? No need to listen, no need to think. Just pull the trigger instead.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730212
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730213
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730214
    m_Localized: 'Luka: All this dirt under my nails is from fighting to survive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730215
    m_Localized: 'Luka: These rashes are the vestiges of days gone by.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730216
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Do you consider having hands that have lived a full life a capital offense?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730217
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730218
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730219
    m_Localized: 'Luka: If you feel like destroying something, try to tear down your own fears first. I believe in you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730220
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730221
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730222
    m_Localized: 'Luka: I don''t want to be your enemy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730223
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730224
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730225
    m_Localized: 'Luka: I sure hope this photo isn''t my last.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730226
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730227
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730228
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Do you really want silence to swallow this house whole? Then the only voice you''ll have to listen to is your own.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730229
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730230
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730231
    m_Localized: 'Luka: You know, I used to hate myself for a lot of things before I realized that life''s not about fixing every flaw.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730232
    m_Localized: 'Luka: It''s about learning to accept yourself. Death is the same way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730233
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Our hands carry it all. Our losses, our joys... Without reaching out to one another, we wouldn''t survive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730234
    m_Localized: 'Luka: My eyes...they''ve seen both joy and death. But I still try to keep them trained straight ahead.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730235
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Smells contain memories too. The smell of home, of fresh-baked bread, of early morning. They give you strength to go on.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730236
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Photographs aren''t just pictures. They''re moments we want to hold on to.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730237
    m_Localized: 'Luka: Hearing isn''t just picking up sounds. It''s about understanding how others feel, even when they don''t say anything.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730238
    m_Localized: 'Luka: If it makes things easier...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730239
    m_Localized: 'Luka: I forgive you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924160
    m_Localized: 'FortuneTeller: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924161
    m_Localized: 'FortuneTeller: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924162
    m_Localized: 'FortuneTeller: I heard a hum in my ears once...as if the universe was whispering to me. But I think it was something far greater.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924163
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924164
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924165
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: You wish to immortalize me on film?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924166
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: Hmm... Hmm...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924167
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: Did you know I once shook hands with the SHINING SUN LEADER himself?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924168
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: It was I who taught him how to stare straight into the Sun. But I''ll gift you that holy tale later, human.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924169
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: Go on, GRACE OUR EYES WITH MY IMMORTALIZATION!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924170
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924171
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: IT SHINES WITH THE RADIANCE OF THE GLORIOUS SUN!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924172
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: Attend me later, human. I shall grace your ears with my entire life story.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924173
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: ...And you can throw a little tithe my way in return.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924174
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: FOR THE SALVATION OF THE SUN!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924175
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924176
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924177
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: Yes! I receive the righteous signals of LIFE straight through my ears! How did you know?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924178
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924179
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: This is processed sunlight pouring out from my HEAD!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924180
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: My brain absorbs the solar energy and gives me strength I need to fight the EVIL UNDERGROUND FILTH!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924181
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924182
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924183
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: JUDGE ME NOT, HUMAN!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924184
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: The holy Sun COOLS me! It would never let me burn in its gleaming shine...beams... You get it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924185
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: ...It''s just my beer aura. Yeah... Holy Beaura... Let''s go with that.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924186
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: I gotta drink beer so my veins stay MOIST and the Sun doesn''t scorch me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924187
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: See? Logic. Now put that thing away and listen to my HOLY WORDS OF SALVATION!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924188
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924189
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924190
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: SHADOW MAD EVIL MAN!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924191
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: You''re not an BEAMLESS UNDERDWELLER, are you? THEN WHY ACT LIKE ONE?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924192
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924193
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924194
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: Let me regale you of the time I taught the Sun Leader how to absorb the Sun''s power, human.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924195
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: So... This scrawny little guy comes to me. Says he wants to know how to survive the Sun.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924196
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: I tell him straight up, "THE HOLY SUN WON''T HURT YOU! But you are WEAK...let me tell you the ways!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924197
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: I hand him a righteous bucket, tell him to go home and paint it black, then put it on his head and step outside.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924198
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: Then shout like so... WAAaaaAAAAAAaaAAAAAH!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924199
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: That way the bucket''ll fill with beer fumes and you can soak up the Sun''s holy beams of power!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924200
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: ...Never saw him again after that. Guess he finally went off to do something useful!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924202
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: Ears aren''t important!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924203
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: Gray matter is a different story, though! You''ve gotta turn it yellow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924204
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: What you were even staring at?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924205
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: If you must talk to me, human. Avert your eyes from my HOLY FLESH!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924206
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: ...And hand me a beer!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924207
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Whaddya you wanna check?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924208
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924209
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924210
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924211
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924212
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924213
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924214
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Teeth, huh? Fine, I''ll show ya.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924215
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924216
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Of course my teeth''re white. I ain''t a savage, son. I wipe my ass, too, if that''s important.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924217
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: My folks wanted me to wear braces when I was a kid, but I ditched the appointment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924218
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Got my ass whooped for it, but I ain''t going to no dentist. No siree.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924219
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924220
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924221
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Let''s move this along, kid.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924222
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924223
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Course my hands are dirty, I spend my nights digging up varmint!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924224
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Makes ''em easier to kill!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924225
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: You should be doing the same, son.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924226
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924227
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924228
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Y''know, kid, my eyes used to be sharp as a pin.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924229
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: But after that last run-in, they ain''t nothing but red.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924230
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: I was taking down some varmint and he threw dirt, or shit, or SOMETHIN'' into my eyes. Hurts all the damn time now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924231
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924232
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Easy, kid. That smarts somethin'' fierce.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924233
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: A life like mine''ll drain the color from any fella''s eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924234
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924235
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924236
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: But I''ll get ''em. Every last one of ''em. Tear ''em apart with my own bare hands.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924237
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Then maybe we can live in peace again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924238
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924239
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924240
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: More signs, more easier we can fine those varmints.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924241
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924242
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: I''m just a normal fella, son. Don''t know what you done expectin'' to see.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924243
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924244
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924245
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: No sirree. I don''t like bein'' photographed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924246
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Flash reminds me of thunder, sets me on edge.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924247
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Nope. I''m ain''t doing it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924248
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924249
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924250
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Heard that report too, kid. ...Fine, take a look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924251
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924252
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Well? What is it? What do you see?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924253
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Hm. Would sure be nice to know what the hell we''re even lookin'' for.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924254
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924255
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924256
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Hm?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924257
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ...Son of a gun!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924258
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924259
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924260
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Woah there... No need to fill me fulla lead.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924261
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: I''m the one watching the windows at night, making sure no varmint sneaks in. Alone...it''s your funeral, kid.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924262
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924263
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924264
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Easy, son... You gonna go round shootin'' amputees too when they ain''t got no nails to show?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924265
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Point me to a doc, and check my eyes after they''re done fixin'' ''em!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924266
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: What''s got ya so on edge, kid?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924267
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Don''t rush to judgment. Always ends in mistakes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924268
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924269
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924270
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Listen here, son.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924271
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Losing our heads only helps the varmint win.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924272
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924273
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924274
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Git! You ain''t gone make me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924275
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Take pictures of somethin'' else. Kill some varmint. I don''t give a hoot...just get your darn camera outta my face!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924276
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ...Hm.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924277
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: I''ll flinch.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924278
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924279
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: SHIT!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924280
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: That it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924281
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924282
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924283
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: So, what, I''m varmint now?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924284
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Figured. How''d you come to that one, eh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924285
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924286
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924287
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: I get it, kid. Stress can get to ya.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924288
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: But it''s the varmint we need to be fightin'', not each other.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924289
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Mighty good thing you came to your senses in time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924290
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Good choice, kid.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924291
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: You comin'' with me to strangle some varmint tonight?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924292
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: C''mon, son. Let''s hunt ''em down together.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924293
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Darn right, kid.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924294
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Ain''t wise to jump to conclusions. On a hunt, that''ll get you ripped to shreds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924295
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Hoowee. Thought you might actually blast me for a second there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924296
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: What tipped you off, son? I don''t match any of them signs, do I?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924297
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Or maybe it''s just the darn pressure of it all?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924298
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Glad ya didn''t put me down, kid.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924299
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Y''know, I sure do hate all this. Cameras, flashes, noise.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924300
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Brrr.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924301
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Ain''t my thing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924302
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: If them news types''re gonna go on ''bout new signs, they could at least tell us what it is.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924303
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Otherwise I might catch some varmint and won''t even know what the hell I''m lookin'' for!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924304
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: This how the varmint feels before I blast ''em?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924305
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: Scared...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924306
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924307
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924308
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: I-If it turns out I''m a Visitor...does that mean I''ll start killing people?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924309
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: Will I be dangerous? Or...was I always dangerous?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924310
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: Maybe... Maybe I already kill people?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924311
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924312
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: Hahaha, can you imagine? So...it''s true then?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924313
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924314
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924315
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: Wh-Why are there so many signs?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924316
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: WHY DO I FIT EVERY SINGLE ONE OF THEM?! HAHAHA!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924317
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924318
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: I DON''T EVEN KNOW WHAT IT MEANS!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924319
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924320
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924321
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: Um... What happens now?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924322
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: Am I allowed to live? O-Or should I just die? What are you going to do?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924323
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924324
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924325
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: Was that the last straw?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924326
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: A-Am I going to die? Are you going to shoot me? Oh no... Oh God, I''m scared! I''m so scared!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924327
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924328
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924329
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: Why is everything in my life always so messed up?! H-Haha!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924330
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: First my back, and now...literally all of this!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924331
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: When will it end?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924332
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: When do I get to go back to the life I had?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924333
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: What are you waiting for?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924334
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: Just...shoot me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924335
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: A-At least then I''ll stop shaking every day... Never knowing what you''ll hate about me this time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924336
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: EITHER KILL ME OR Q-QUIT SCARING ME!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924337
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: Enough...please. I had it bad enough at home. ...I just want some peace.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924338
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924339
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924340
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: All these tests for signs, guys in yellow suits...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924341
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: It''s all...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924342
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ...A fucked-up mess.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924343
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: Ever get the sense that it''s all leading to some kind of terrifying hell?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924344
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: Everything''s supposedly under control, but there''s complete chaos all around us.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924345
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: Well, take your damn photo.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924346
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924347
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: I''m just terrified of what will happen next.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924348
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: Do you even know what you''re looking for?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924349
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: What to watch out for?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924350
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: Watching you fumble around has really driven home just how royally fucked we are.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924351
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924352
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: Tomorrow they''ll tell you to cut up some kid and you won''t even think twice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924353
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: Fuck... How the hell did I end up in this goddamn nightmare?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924354
    m_Localized: 'Cold: What do you want to ch-check?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924355
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924356
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924357
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924358
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924359
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924360
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924361
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Mm, t-t-teeth?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924362
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Sure... T-Take a look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924363
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924364
    m_Localized: 'Cold: I bite my lips until they b-bleed sometimes... Just to feel the warmth of my own b-b-blood.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924365
    m_Localized: 'Cold: A reminder that I''m s-still alive...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924366
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924367
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924368
    m_Localized: 'Cold: N-Nails? Sure, I''ll show you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924369
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Hm. I t-tore them all off.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924370
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Still, you can t-take a look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924371
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924372
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Do you think my n-n-nails match what they say about the Visitors?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924373
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924374
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924375
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Now... Eyes are a window to hell, not to the s-soul.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924376
    m_Localized: 'Cold: My soul b-burned out long ago. Maybe that''s why I''m so c-c-cold.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924377
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924378
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Narrow p-pupils?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924379
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Probably because the c-c-cold has tightened my skin...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924380
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Shame the sun still b-burns me like everyone else.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924381
    m_Localized: 'Cold: At least my flesh was w-warm as it charred...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924382
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924383
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924384
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Mm...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924385
    m_Localized: 'Cold: I... I need a m-moment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924386
    m_Localized: 'Cold: J-Just...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924387
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ...Now. Look. Q-Quickly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924388
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924389
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Yes. That was unpleasant.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924390
    m_Localized: 'Cold: I b-bared all... Out of respect for you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924391
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924392
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924393
    m_Localized: 'Cold: What does a photograph p-prove?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924394
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Does it not s-seem strange to you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924395
    m_Localized: 'Cold: B-B-But...it''s not up to me. Is it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924396
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924397
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Did you see something?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924398
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Sh-Show me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924399
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924400
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924401
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Our b-bodies are nothing but holes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924402
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Maybe that''s why p-p-people vanish so easily? S-Swallowed up the moment you turn away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924403
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924404
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Even those c-closest will disappear. S-Sooner or later.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924405
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924406
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924407
    m_Localized: 'Cold: P-Perhaps soon I won''t need to remember...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924408
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924409
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924410
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Mm, you can''t really ch-check my hands when they''re like th-this.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924411
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Forgive me... P-Please don''t shoot.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924412
    m_Localized: 'Cold: There''s s-s-something I''d like to tell you... But... But...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924413
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924414
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924415
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Is that the k-killer in you talking? My eyes aren''t r-red.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924416
    m_Localized: 'Cold: D-Don''t let me stop you. Waiting is worse than d-d-death.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924417
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924418
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924419
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Is there f-fungus? Probably because I''m still sweating under my c-coats.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924420
    m_Localized: 'Cold: My body''s f-f-fighting something...but what''s the point?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924421
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924422
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924423
    m_Localized: 'Cold: C-Can I keep the photo? No one''s ever t-t-taken one of me before.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924424
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Feels n-nice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924425
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924426
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924427
    m_Localized: 'Cold: What do you see in the v-void?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924428
    m_Localized: 'Cold: D-Does it remind you of yourself?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924429
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924430
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924431
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Th-Thank you for trusting me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924432
    m_Localized: 'Cold: I hope I can be of s-some use to you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924433
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Something''s gnawing at me, but I can''t sh-share what yet...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924434
    m_Localized: 'Cold: You know, I''m t-tired of living like this.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924435
    m_Localized: 'Cold: But you chose not to k-kill me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924436
    m_Localized: 'Cold: M-M-Meanwhile, somewhere else, someone else was k-killed in their own home.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924437
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Ever think about why that is?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924438
    m_Localized: 'Cold: L-Life left my eyes long ago.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924439
    m_Localized: 'Cold: All that''s left is endless l-loneliness.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924440
    m_Localized: 'Cold: I can''t grow close to anyone. All it brings is p-pain...and suffering.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924441
    m_Localized: 'Cold: I m-miss the quiet life.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924442
    m_Localized: 'Cold: You know, before the real threat of extinction as a s-s-species.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924443
    m_Localized: 'Cold: When we were top of the food ch-chain. When you could walk outside in the s-s-sun.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924444
    m_Localized: 'Cold: I was still too c-cold to take off my c-c-coat then, of course.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924445
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Tell me—how many more signs will it t-take for them to figure out what needs to be d-d-done?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924446
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Why does anyone need to d-die?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924447
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Or maybe it was never n-necessary to begin with?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924448
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924449
    m_Localized: 'Cold: I... I guess I ask too many p-personal questions sometimes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924450
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Ignore them if you w-want.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924451
    m_Localized: 'Cold: J-Just thought I''d ask.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924452
    m_Localized: 'Cold: Probably p-pointless...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924453
    m_Localized: 'Cold: You know...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924454
    m_Localized: 'Cold: I think I finally understand why I''m so c-c-cold.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924455
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924456
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924457
    m_Localized: 'Widow: Really? That doesn''t seem humiliating to you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924458
    m_Localized: 'Widow: No one helped me save my husband, and now...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924459
    m_Localized: 'Widow: YOU WANT TO MEMORIALIZE HIS DEATH?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924460
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924461
    m_Localized: 'Widow: I have no words left.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924462
    m_Localized: 'Widow: Just do what you want and leave me alone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924463
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924464
    m_Localized: 'Widow: Happy now? Then leave.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924465
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924466
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924467
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924468
    m_Localized: 'Widow: What do you want from me?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924469
    m_Localized: 'Widow: I''ve run out of patience for your bullshit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924470
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924471
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924472
    m_Localized: 'Widow: Of course, my picture would turn out such a sallow blue...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924473
    m_Localized: 'Widow: You know why that is. You know how hard this is for me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924474
    m_Localized: 'Widow: And yet you keep tormenting me... Why?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924475
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924476
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924477
    m_Localized: 'Widow: Really? You''d go that far...?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924478
    m_Localized: 'Widow: I don''t know what to tell you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924479
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924480
    m_Localized: 'Widow: Did you find what you wanted?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924481
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924482
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924483
    m_Localized: 'Widow: I have only one photograph left with him.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924484
    m_Localized: 'Widow: Is that all I get to keep? Just a picture?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924485
    m_Localized: 'Widow: And even that will crease, tear, and fade with time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924486
    m_Localized: 'Widow: I''ll never get to speak to him again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924487
    m_Localized: 'Widow: I want to rest. Could you leave?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924488
    m_Localized: 'Widow: I''m just going to sit here. I hope you''ll let me be alone with my thoughts at least.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924489
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924490
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924491
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: Wanna snap a pic together? Aight.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924492
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: I''m pretty sensitive to light, f''real.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924493
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924494
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: Fuck yeah! That''s what I''m talkin'' about, bro!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924495
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: Aww, what the hell? You can only see dumb shapes. Waste of a bitchin'' pose.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924496
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: Aww, what the hell? You didn''t even clean your lens! Look, it''s all fucky!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924497
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924498
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924499
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: Hey, hands off my hustle, bro!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118464
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: You take a peek, tell ''em they''ve got a Visitor Spirit in ''em, then charge ''em crazy cash to keep your mouth shut. Boom!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118465
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: I''m down with it, cause we''re bros, bro. But don''t try to pull none of that sus shit on me, yeah?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118466
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118467
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: Bitchin'' right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118468
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118469
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118470
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: Damn, bro! Over a fuckin'' photo?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118471
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: I lost my aunt''s house in a card game once, and even she didn''t screw me this hard!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118472
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118473
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118474
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: C''mon, bro... I told you...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118475
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: I''m fuckin'' broke, man. Lost it all at the casino, every last dime.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118476
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118477
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118478
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: Don''t pull that scam shit on me, bitch. Save it for those other suckers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118479
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: Gotta keep ''em on edge. You feel me?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118480
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: You don''t and they''ll relax, forget whose crib they''re in, and won''t pay up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118481
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: Yoooo! Had me sweatin'' balls there, bro!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118482
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: All G, man! Least the rent''s free here!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118483
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: I just need to grind the hustle. Get straight cash, yeah, then I can buy myself a new pad! King shit, bro!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118484
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118485
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118486
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: A photograph?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118487
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: I don''t have many pictures of me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118488
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: Will you show me it after?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118489
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118490
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: Mmm.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118491
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ...Thanks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118492
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: I don''t like it. Please don''t do it again...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118493
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: Daddy said you have to be careful of ticks and bugs. Is that what you''re looking for?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118494
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118495
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: Thanks for checking, mister!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118496
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: I''ll tell him for sure you''re not a Visitor when he comes to pick me up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118497
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: He''ll probably be here soon!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118498
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: What is it you wanna check, darlin''?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118499
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118500
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118501
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118502
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118503
    m_Localized: A photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118504
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118505
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Bless your heart! What teeth, darlin''?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118506
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Go on, take yourself a good ol'' look!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118507
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118508
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: So?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118509
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: What? An old gal like me wantin'' for veneers, so now she ain''t no right to live no more?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118510
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118511
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118512
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: That one ain''t gone work...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118513
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Growin'' old ain''t a joy, darlin''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118514
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118515
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Don''t even remember what this here sickness is called, but my dang nails been fallin'' clean off.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118516
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Hurts like hell, I tell ya what.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118517
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118518
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118519
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Darlin'', I''ve always had busted vessels in my eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118520
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Don''t see how you reckon you''ll figure I''m a Visitor with that.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118521
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118522
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: So, what now?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118523
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118524
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118525
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Momma''s gettin'' old, darlin''. My body just ain''t what it used to be.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118526
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118527
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Itches all the darn time, too. Ain''t got a clue else to do ''bout it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118528
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Tried a whole buncha things, but nothin'' helps.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118529
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118530
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118531
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Ain''t nobody taken a photo of Momma in years!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118532
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Go on, darlin''. Why not?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118533
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118534
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: How come y''all can hardly see nothin''? S''all just smudges and spots.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118535
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118536
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118537
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: At night I hear this scratchin''. Like somethin''s crawlin'' ''round underneath us.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118538
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118539
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Oh, dagnabbit! Grab that thing! Kill it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118540
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118541
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118542
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Now, that just ain''t right! A shotgun ain''t how you deal with these situations, darlin''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118543
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Best way''s a knife in the back. ...Or maybe some poison. ...Take Momma''s word for it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118544
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118545
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118546
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Don''t you fret, darlin''—these hands still know how to protect my brood.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118547
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118548
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118549
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Past three years my eyesight''s done been gettin'' worse and worse.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118550
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Guess them busted vessels don''t heal up like they used to.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118551
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Don''t suppose it''s cancer, do ya?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118552
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118553
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118554
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: HAHAHA! Now there''s a medicine for all what ails ya!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118555
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Well, darlin''? Gonna patch up poor, ailin'' Momma?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118556
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118557
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118558
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Whatcha say? An aura?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118559
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Reckon that darn thing''s busted. They cleaned you out an'' y''all just ate it up like apple pie!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118560
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: HAHAHA! That''s tickled Momma!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118561
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118562
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118563
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Me? Run? I ain''t goin'' nowhere, darlin''! Go catch that damn roach!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118564
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: I hate them critters. Damn thing wriggled right into my ear.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118565
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118566
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118567
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Whoa, there! Watch where y''all swingin'' that damn thing!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118568
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Keep pointin'' that there gun at folks and soon everyone''s gonna be lookin'' at y''all mighty strange.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118569
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Can''t keep a hold of it all day and night, now can ya?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118570
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: What good''s it gone do... Puttin'' a bullet in poor old Momma...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118571
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Might just do me a kindness...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118572
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Figure I got plenty more hurt left in me yet, darlin''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118573
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Of course that ain''t no sign of nothin''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118574
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Be awful sad if your finger slipped. Put down a kind, livin'' soul by mistake.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118575
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: How many times you done been wrong? Heart carry the weight o'' them murders?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118576
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Heard a sayin'' lately: if nothin'' hurts, means you''re already dead.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118577
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Ain''t just old folks neither—that''s how everyone''s livin'' these days, sick ''n rotten near all the time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118578
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Bless your heart! Can Momma keep this one?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118579
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Ain''t got no photos left no more. Don''t care much for this one neither...but hell, I''ll keep it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118580
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: And what ''bout you, darlin''? Never had a bug crawl out from where the sun don''t shine?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118581
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: My ears are the healthiest part o'' me left.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118582
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Just hope the damn roach didn''t lay no darn eggs in my brain.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118583
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Go on, honey... Shoot.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118584
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: Once Momma''s gone, my brood will come... They''ll come for every last one of y''all...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118585
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: HAHAHAHAHA!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118586
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118587
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118588
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: You''re wastin'' that film on lil ol'' me? Well, I''ll be!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118589
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118590
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: Well, deary? What now?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118591
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118592
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118593
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: Mercy me! Now that''s quite the notion.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118594
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118595
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: Could hear a pin drop, deary. But you know... Sometimes, I feel like I''m fading.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118596
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: Like I can only be seen in the lightest light, and not always even then.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118597
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118598
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118599
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: Oh goodness gracious, are you really going to shoot an old lady?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118600
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118601
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118602
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: And what now, deary? Can a pair of old ears really tell you that much?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118603
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118604
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118605
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: Back in my day, only the rich had such fancy things. Now every handy young lad''s got one!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118606
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: Feh! I''ve nothin'' more to tell you, deary. It''s all just flapdoodle. You''re worryin'' good folks for nothing...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118607
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118608
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118609
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: Now, I don''t buy into all this flapdoodle aura business.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118610
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: Everything we do, everywhere we end up—that''s by our own choice. Not any of that hocus-pocus applesauce.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118611
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118612
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: So... How is it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118613
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118614
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118615
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: Wait... What''s the Visitor sign again?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118616
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: What are you looking for?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118617
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118618
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: So? What''s your conclusion?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118619
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118620
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118621
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: Wait... You don''t actually believe in all this, do you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118622
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118623
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118624
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: You think I''m a Visitor? How''d you come to that decision?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118625
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: What exactly set you off? Do you even know?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118626
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118627
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118628
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: So it was a joke? Don''t ever do that again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118629
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: All this with my husband already has me on edge.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118630
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: He''s... He''s coming soon. He must be...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118631
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: You scared me half to death.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118632
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: I just hope FEMA knows what they''re doing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118633
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: All these so-called "signs"... I don''t know. Sometimes I think it''s all madness.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118634
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: And sometimes, I''ve never been more certain.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118635
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118636
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118637
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118638
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118639
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: I don''t care if anything''s left after.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118640
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: Do whatever you think you should.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118641
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118642
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: And what is that?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118643
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118644
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118645
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: All I have left is an earring.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118646
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: It reminds me of my parents.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118647
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118648
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: My sister took hers off.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118649
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: I should get rid of mine too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118650
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: It hurts her to be reminded of them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118651
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118652
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118653
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: Burn that picture too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118654
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118655
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118656
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: Don''t wait.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118657
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: Just do what needs to be done.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118658
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118659
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118660
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: What''s taking you so long? Quit aiming and just fire.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118661
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: Visitors won''t jump you just because you point a gun at them. They won''t give themselves away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118662
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: There''s only one simple way to be sure...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118663
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: What do you think''s gonna kill us in the end?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118664
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: Visitors? Disasters? Each other?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118665
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: How long''s it gonna take?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118666
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118667
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118668
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Take a gander, sunshine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118669
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118670
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118671
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118672
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118673
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118674
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118675
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Careful now, sunshine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118676
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Get too close and I''ll have to sink these teeth right into your neck.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118677
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118678
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: I look after my gnashers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118679
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: What about the ones I''m missin''?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118680
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Well, let the bastards what took ''em hold ''em tight in their graves.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118681
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118682
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118683
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: You wanna know about my hands, issit?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118684
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Yeah, they ain''t clean. Killed some mug just the other day, actually.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118685
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: They tried to kill me first, mate. Like I''d just stand there waitin'' like a muppet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118686
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Some freeze, some run.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118687
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Me? I hit back, sunshine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118688
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118689
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Well? Satisfied?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118690
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118691
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118692
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Looking to find a stranger in me? Eh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118693
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Not afraid you''ll see yourself in there?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118694
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118695
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Good boy...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118696
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Most can''t look me in the eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118697
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118698
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118699
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: That, I don''t respect, sunshine. And I''ll remember it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118700
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118701
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Deodorant dries my skin out. But, better than sweatin'' up my clobber.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118702
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: A man oughta smell natural though...if he''s got nothing to hide, that is.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118703
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118704
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118705
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: I don''t appreciate bein'' photographed, sunshine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118706
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: If I find out those photos''ve ended up anywhere but the rubbish, you and me''ll be ''aving words.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118707
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Got it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118708
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118709
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Would ya look at that!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118710
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Oi. Hand it over. I''ll chuck it out myself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118711
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118712
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118713
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: What next? "My, what big teeth you ''ave!" This is mental.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118714
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118715
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Maybe I oughta strap you in a straitjacket before you go hurtin'' yourself, eh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118716
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118717
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118718
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Ciggies don''t just ruin greedy bastards. They soften the gums, too. Weak bite.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118719
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Think no one''s ever pointed a gun at me before, sunshine?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118720
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118721
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118722
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: You gonna pull the trigger or what?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118723
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: And then what?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118724
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118725
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118726
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Saw your own reflection, did ya?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118727
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: I wouldn''t, sunshine. I''d just come for your ''ide in the afterlife.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118728
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118729
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118730
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Making a respectable geezer jump through hoops, then you go and throw threats on top?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118731
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: You wouldn''t get very far back where I''m from, sunshine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118732
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118733
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118734
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: You don''t earn respect by wavin'' your shooter around, now do ya?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118735
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: A beaten mutt ain''t loyal...one day it''ll bite your hand clean off.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118736
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118737
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118738
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Too slow, sunshine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118739
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: If you love being on your tod so much...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118740
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Why not just pop the lot of us and be done with it, eh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118741
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118742
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118743
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Down boy...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118744
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: I know you—what time you go to bed, how long you kip.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118745
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Push me, sunshine...and I''ll tear you apart.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118746
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: No more muckin'' about.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118747
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: I''m quicker than you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118748
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: I''ll have that shooter off you quicker than you can cough.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118749
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Easy now, down boy...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118750
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: I had you pegged wrong.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118751
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Raising a shooter and not followin'' through? That shows doubt, sunshine. And doubt is a dangerous thing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118752
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: You''re fast working your way onto my shitlist, sunshine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118753
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Pull that again we''ll be havin'' ourselves more than just words. Are we understandin'' each other, sunshine?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118754
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: You''re havin'' a laugh.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118755
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: You''re like a puppy playin'' fetch with a firework. Something don''t fit proper.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118756
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Best put it down before you take someone''s eye out, eh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118757
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Look, mate... You''re making a proper tit of yourself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118758
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Sit down and let the grown-ups handle things ''ere, pup.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118759
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: That''s how it is, issit?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312768
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: Let''s see who''s quicker, sunshine...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312769
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: AAAAAARGH!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312770
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: What do you wish to examine?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312771
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312772
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312773
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312774
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312775
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312776
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312777
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Thank you for your concern, but my teeth are in perfect health.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312778
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Ah, you mean to check for signs of being a Visitor.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312779
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Of course, take a look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312780
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312781
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Perfect, aren''t they?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312782
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: A friend of mine did them for me, free of charge.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312783
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: And I operated on him not long ago.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312784
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: I wonder how he''s doing now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312785
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312786
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312787
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Yes, these hands have performed countless surgeries.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312788
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: I could tell you operating table stories for days...but maybe another time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312789
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: For now, please, take a look at them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312790
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312791
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: I try to keep these hands in decent shape, never let them grow stiff.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312792
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: You never know what tomorrow might bring.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312793
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312794
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312795
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Of course, I''ll show you my eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312796
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Not sure if you noticed, I''ve got polycoria.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312797
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: It''s an official diagnosis, yes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312798
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312799
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Unfortunately it makes my sight worse, not better.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312800
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: You''d think two pupils in one eye would increase visual acuity.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312801
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: But...no.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312802
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312803
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312804
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Yes, just a moment. I''m not as quick as I used to be.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312805
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312806
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: I try to stay hygienic.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312807
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: It''s important when you don''t know when your next bath might be. Could be I''m covered in the same grime for a week, ha!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312808
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312809
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312810
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: No problem at all.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312811
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: You have to thoroughly check every little thing. I can only assume this must be part of it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312812
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312813
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: People always said I have a strange look about me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312814
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: What do you think?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312815
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312816
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312817
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Fair enough. I trust you know what you''re doing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312818
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312819
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: And since I''m still standing here, you must be making the right calls.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312820
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312821
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312822
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Wait, hold on!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312823
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: You''re making a mistake—I can save lives!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312824
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: And now you''re about to take one...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312825
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312826
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312827
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Wait, this is normal. I am a doctor, with no proper way to sanitize!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312828
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Tell me—just what do you suppose a "correct" hand looks like?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312829
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312830
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312831
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Interesting. A pity I can''t study how your paranoia developed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312832
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: But mental health isn''t my specialty, so it wouldn''t do to draw conclusions anyway.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312833
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312834
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312835
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Think carefully before making such a grave choice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312836
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Or better yet, check something else. You should keep the whole picture in mind.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312837
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312838
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312839
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Amazing. Do you truly believe in aura photography?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312840
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Do you charge your water in front of the TV, too?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312841
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312842
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312843
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: I''ve made my peace with death after all my years in hospitals. Now I wonder why everyone else fights so hard to hold on.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312844
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: I never got used to death, even after all my years in hospitals. No matter what happens, people still want to live.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312845
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312846
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312847
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: If you want, we could fix your teeth too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312848
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Cheaply, of course. Since you helped me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312849
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Once all this business with the sun is over, that is.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312850
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Better to be careful, sure.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312851
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: But could you live with the weight of your guilt if you''re wrong?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312852
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Scary isn''t it? In times like these, nobody''s in control of the horrors unraveling around us.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312853
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: One would expect FEMA to handle things, but...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312854
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Let''s just say I wouldn''t count on them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312855
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Never rush to a decision. Always keep your head clear, see the whole picture.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312856
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: That''s what working in hospitals taught me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312857
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ...And why I had to leave.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312858
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Tell me, why do you believe in auras? Did you really feel something when you pressed that button?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312859
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Why so quick to trust this "photo test" from FEMA? Doesn''t it feel like something cobbled together to calm people down?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312860
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: I''ve seen too much suffering over these long years...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312861
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: Sometimes you wonder if life is even worth it. It all feels like some impossible task. Every day is nothing but pain.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312862
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ...And yet nobody wants to give it up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312863
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: We''ll see how much longer we can endure.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312864
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: No, don''t shoot, please...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312865
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: I''m just a doctor...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312866
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: R wlmg fmwvihgzmw. Dszg wl blf dzmg uiln nv?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
