      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312926
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: R orpv kslglh. Yfg blf ziv mlg nfxs lu z uzm, ziv blf?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312927
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: R dlfow trev zmbgsrmt gl hvv srn ztzrm. Nrhh srn hl nfxs. WOT, wlvh gsrh nvzm hlnvgsrmt?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312928
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: Gszgh sld rg tlvh. Gsvb wlmg fmwvihgzmw blf, gsvb uvzi blf, zmw gsvb...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312929
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ...Proo blf.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312930
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: All that I am has long since become a story.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312931
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312932
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312933
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312934
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312935
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312936
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312937
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: I remember how pearls shone in her mouth... How I cherished her smile...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312938
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312939
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: And mine... Like fallen autumn leaves, turned to mulch in October rain.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312940
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Behold... The cost of love.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312941
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312942
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312943
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: She had such tender hands. At times I feared they would dissolve into mine, like she was a ghost…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312944
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312945
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: The right hand is no longer mine. Decay takes it...little by little.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312946
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: The left still clings on. See the nails? Neat. Clean.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312947
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312948
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312949
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Even the memory of her eyes unsettles me so... Forgive me, you wished to see my own...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312950
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312951
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: They say those who weep over much see the world in deeper shades. But I have not wept in a long time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312952
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: I no longer search for her face. Acceptance is truly the hardest lesson.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312953
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: And yet, by habit, I seek her shape. Every corner-eye shadow a trace of her form.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312954
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312955
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312956
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Yes, of course.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312957
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312958
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: The body resents stillness... To be held in place for too long. At first, I was saving myself for her.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312959
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: But that proved meaningless.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312960
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: The body resents stillness... To be held in place for too long. Alas, I had no choice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312961
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312962
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312963
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Very well.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312964
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312965
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Well then...how do I appear?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312966
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Or rather...what was it you saw?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312967
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312968
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312969
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: What was, remains.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312970
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312971
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: One of few things left unchanged.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312972
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312973
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312974
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: You wish to fill me adread? Alas, my friend. This form is only a shell—falling apart as the days pass by.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312975
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312976
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312977
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: I must say, I had wished to go into that good night on my own terms...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312978
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312979
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312980
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Let me walk my path alone. Spare your bullets...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312981
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312982
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312983
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: When you lay beside someone long enough...you absorb their essence. She has woven herself into my very flesh—my spirit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312984
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312985
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312986
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Intriguing...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312987
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312988
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312989
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Well then...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312990
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312991
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312992
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: She always kissed me as though she feared each time may be the last. Now I understand why.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312993
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: I tried so long to preserve my hand...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312994
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: I thought if even one part of me stayed clean, it would serve as a reminder. But now...what meaning is left in that?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312995
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Much better.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312996
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Whenever I gazed into her eyes, I found the heavens themselves reflected in those milky pools.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312997
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: And now—emptiness. Black holes drawing me deeper and deeper. Only to find echoes now reside in those sockets.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312998
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Foreign words. Foreign voices. The dead speaking in her place.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312999
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Strange... They say the living take something from the dead if they linger beside them too long.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313000
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: But what if it''s the other way around?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313001
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Photographs preserve appearances, not the soul. Were I a painter, I''d have captured her on canvas.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313002
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: But alas... I am but a hopeless romantic... She lives on only in my memory, until I, too, am gone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313003
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: She loved to whisper sweet nothings in my ear. Though I never quite knew what she said.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313004
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: Perhaps I only wished to believe her words were sweet. For she were already dead...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313005
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: I am coming to you...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313006
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: My dearest...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313007
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Uh, hey man, don''t take this the wrong way, but... Listen, I''m not sayin'' no, just... Bah, you''ll see for yourself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313008
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313009
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313010
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313011
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313012
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313013
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313014
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Teeth are just teeth, you know? Nothin'' special.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313015
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: I always kinda kept an eye on mine. Even whitened ''em when I was a kid.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313016
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313017
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: My folks used to tell me my smile was the first thing people''d see. First impressions, and all that.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313018
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313019
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313020
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Alright... They ain''t exactly pretty, though.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313021
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313022
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: They''re just normal hands, man. I figure if I didn''t smoke, I''d have picked my fingers bloody from the nerves by now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313023
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: They''re just normal hands, man. I know, my nails ain''t exactly clean. I''m always pickin'' at the wheel in traffic.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313024
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: If I didn''t, the road rage''d drive all my customers off, hahaha!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313025
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313026
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313027
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: My eyes are always tired. Hard to keep ''em shut though.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313028
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313029
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: I''m just used to... watchin'' everything. Who''s drivin'' behind me, who''s starin'', who''s stayin'' eerily quiet...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313030
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Work habits. Can''t shake ''em. So I kinda got insomnia now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313031
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313032
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Ever since they took my car, I can''t sleep at night.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313033
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Work habits, y''know? Watchin'' who''s drivin'' behind me, who''s starin'', who''s stayin'' eerily quiet... Can''t shake it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313034
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313035
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313036
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Nothin'' special about ''em, really.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313037
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313038
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Except when I drive for too long. Makes my shoulders ache, you know? Sometimes I can''t even lift my arms.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313039
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: But hey, I''m kinda used to it. Especially now...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313040
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313041
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313042
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Go on, man. I''m ready.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313043
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313044
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: So... whaddya see? Probably just me, huh? Nothin'' special, I''m sure.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313045
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: I used to keep photos of me with my pops in the cab. Now the only ones takin'' pictures of me are the feds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313046
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: And you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313047
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313048
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313049
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: My ears? They''re just like anybody else''s. Nothin'' interestin'' about ''em.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313050
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313051
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: I get a lot of use out ''em, though. Passengers like to talk. I don''t interrupt. I just... listen. Take mental notes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313052
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Sometimes I kinda hear too much, though, y''know?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313053
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313054
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313055
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: H-Hey man, I ain''t crazy! It''s just... somethin'' that''s stuck with me since that moment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313056
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: The teeth kinda reminded me of somebody, y''know. A bad somebody.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313057
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Listen, I''m just sayin'', my pops crossed paths with him once...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313058
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Since then I been smokin'', and you can see what that crap did to my own not-so-pearly whites...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313059
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313060
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313061
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Heh... You kiddin''? Bein'' behind the wheel is a trial by fire, man, every time. I''m sure you know what I mean.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313062
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Some folks hit the wheel, some yell, some start fights. We each got our way of dealin''. So lay off the wise cracks, yeah?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313063
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313064
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313065
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Come on, man. I ain''t exactly stupid. I know you''re takin'' me for a Visitor, y''know?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313066
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: But you''re wrong, yeah? You really gonna pull the trigger on an innocent guy?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313067
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313068
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313069
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: If you really want to—I''m not saying don''t. Ain''t like anybody ever had my back anyway, y''know?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313070
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313071
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313072
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Look, if you''ve already made up your mind based on whatever some camera showed you...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313073
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Then, no two ways about it. There ain''t exactly anything left for me to say.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313074
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313075
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313076
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Listen, if you want, I''ll hear you out. That''s somethin'' I''m good at. Ain''t much of my own story left to tell anyhow...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313077
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313078
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313079
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: You''re probably wonderin'' why I don''t quit smokin'' if it''s wreckin'' my teeth, right...?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507072
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: You''re probably wonderin'' why I bleach my teeth, right...?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507073
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Maybe so I can look like somebody else. But not in a Visitor way, you know? Just like, ah you get me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507074
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Anyway, there was this local big shot in the cab once. Everybody knew him. Even a scrappy lil kid like me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507075
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: On the surface he looked normal. Smoked like a chimney, though.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507076
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: On the surface he looked normal. But his smile... white as porcelain.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507077
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: My old man made a bad call that day, and we paid for it. Lived like rats after. No home, no money, no nothin''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507078
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: I used to think strong hands were important. Control your car, control your life. Now... hell, what''s the point anymore?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507079
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: I''m always kinda scanning around, you know?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507080
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Lookin'' for my next passenger, wonderin'' if they''re really who they say they are.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507081
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Sorry if that creeps you out. Now that my cab''s gone, I should probably quit spookin'' folks with talk like that...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507082
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Sometimes I think... if I''d had someone to hold, maybe I wouldn''t have gone out there lookin'' for a fare.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507083
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Wouldn''t have picked him up. Wouldn''t have lost it all...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507084
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Maybe you saw somethin'' human in me after all...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507085
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: I ain''t perfect. But I tried. Honest.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507086
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: You know the scariest thing, huh? When a passenger kinda just sits there, all quiet-like.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507087
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: You start hearin'' your own thoughts. Louder than the radio. Won''t shut up, won''t leave you alone...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507088
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: Just let the wind take the ashes, yeah? Don''t want no part of me lyin'' around...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507089
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: In this dirt...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507090
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Been watching TV, have we? Bought into that whole Visitors thing, have we? Fine, do your tests, but I know my rights!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507091
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507092
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507093
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507094
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507095
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507096
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507097
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Maybe you''d like to see if there are any leftovers you can scavenge while you''re in there, hm?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507098
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507099
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Well? Happy now, are we? Or are you going to commit premediated murder because I brush my teeth, hm?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507100
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507101
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507102
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: My hands? What for?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507103
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507104
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Actually, a little dirt under my nails cannot fully prove anything now, can it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507105
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Actually, a smattering of untrimmed nails cannot fully prove anything now, can it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507106
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507107
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507108
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: And what are you even looking for, hm? Redness?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507109
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: And what are you hoping to find there, hm? An evil stare?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507110
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507111
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: See? No redness!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507112
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Well? Found anything?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507113
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507114
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507115
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: What?! My armpits?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507116
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507117
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Oh, so now I''m a Visitor because I dislike the sensation of sweating. Quick lock me up, sweat is now a capital offence!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507118
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507119
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507120
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Want me to say cheese for you, too? Hm?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507121
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: I''m sure it''ll prove...something.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507122
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507123
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507124
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507125
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Oh, believe anything the TV says, do we?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507126
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: What if they say Visitors all have pubic hair, hm? Will we need to drop our pants for your unconstitutional inspections?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507127
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507128
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Playing doctor now, are we? Well, what''s the prognosis, Dr. Cleverclogs?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507129
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507130
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507131
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Well, actually, I wouldn''t expect anything less from you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507132
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Why not! You''ve already broken every law! Might as well add brushed tooth murder to the list!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507133
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507134
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507135
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Oh what a delight. A microscopic amount of dirt makes me evil now, does it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507136
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: I know every rule. Which have I broken?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507137
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507138
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507139
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Seriously?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507140
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507141
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507142
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Well, actually, I twitched when you took the photo, so if anything that makes YOU suspicious.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507143
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Oh, wonderful! You can, let me get this right... "read an aura"... by looking at a photo now?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507144
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Might as well just flip a coin to decide who you shoot next.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507145
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507146
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507147
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Nowhere in the entire constitution does it forbid a man to shave his own pits!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507148
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: And wouldn''t that mean your so-called Visitors are all sitting around, underground, landscaping their bodily fluff? Hm?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507149
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507150
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Brilliant! No logic whatsoever! Why not, let''s believe that too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507151
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507152
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507153
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Maybe stop pointing that gun every time something doesn''t line up with what you saw on the all-knowing tellybox. Hm?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507154
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Or is a good strong shotgun blast the cure for earwax, Doc?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507155
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507156
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507157
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Well, would you look at that! You do have a meager shred of common sense left in that skull!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507158
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Why even let people in if you''re going to immediately shoot them? You have NO respect for the tenancy LAW!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507159
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: You can''t just commit felonies for every tiny inconsistency! Or even a large inconsistency!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507160
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: That''s it, you''re clinically insane. First you point a gun at me, then you put it away like nothing happened!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507161
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Drop the comedy act already! There are no Visitors!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507162
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: You''ll have me going gray at this rate!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507163
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: So... what, you want me to stop shaving my armpits? A little pit stubble gonna stop you from committing mass murder?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507164
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Unbelievable...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507165
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: And don''t expect any gratitude just because you didn''t blow my brains out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507166
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Here we go again! Since when is earwax a sign of anything other than good ear health? World''s gone mad...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507167
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: Wait—you''re not actually going to pull that trigger, are you? Th-That''s a criminal offence!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507168
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: NO! STOP! I-IT''S AGAINST THE LAW!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507169
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: NOOOOOO!!!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507170
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Sure, why not. I''m used to people thinkin'' I''m suspicious anyways.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507171
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507172
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507173
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507174
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507175
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507176
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507177
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Alrighty. I''ll show ya, and I''ll tell ya the story too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507178
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507179
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: What''s with the face? Yeah, I don''t brush. Never did, never will. My choice, pal.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507180
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: What''s the point? People avoid me either way. I''d rather drink the water I get than waste it rinsin'' my teeth.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507181
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507182
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507183
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Hands, palms, fingers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507184
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507185
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: My nails... ain''t exactly clean. No point scrubbin'' when I''m just gonna get ''em dirty again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507186
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: My nails... ain''t exactly clean. Yeah...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507187
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Funny, though. These fingers''ve touched a trove''s worth o'' treasures. Pure gold has passed through ''em...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507188
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: And none of it''s mine now. Maybe that''s fine. Least I''m still alive, eh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507189
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507190
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507191
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Just regular ol'' eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507192
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507193
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Nothing special. See for yourself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507194
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507195
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507196
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Damn... and here I thought I was the one who didn''t know how to get by in polite society...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507197
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507198
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Yeah, they''re irritated. They ache. But what''s anyone gonna do about that on the streets, eh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507199
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507200
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507201
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Come on? Really?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507202
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Fine, fine. Your house, your rules...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507203
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507204
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Oh man... Think your machine can really see what''s goin'' on inside?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507205
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507206
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507207
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: They''re not torn or chewed up like some stray mog. Just regular ol'' ears.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507208
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507209
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Happy?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507210
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507211
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507212
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Hah. So bad teeth are a death sentence now? Didn''t know the world worked like that these days.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507213
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507214
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507215
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Shootin'' a scavenger ''cause he took somethin'' nobody else needed anymore. Hah!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507216
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507217
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507218
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: What did you see that you didn''t you like? Maybe we can talk about it, yeah?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507219
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507220
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507221
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Look, even if I found some kinda ointment that''d help, I''d sell it. Just sayin''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507222
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507223
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507224
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: If a photo''s enough for you to judge me, then hell, I''m a goner.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507225
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Least then I won''t have to keep draggin'' out this life.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507226
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507227
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507228
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: What, you don''t like my ears now?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507229
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507230
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507231
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Had a pal once, y''know. Kept frettin'' ''cause he lost a filling.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507232
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Then he went an'' lost his whole damn head. Pretty sure teeth weren''t on his mind then...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507233
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Found a house once, looked empty.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507234
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Took an old pocket watch off a shelf. Thought it might be worth somethin''. Then I heard footsteps upstairs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507235
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Scared the hell outta me. Bolted right out. Didn''t even care if anyone was actually there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507236
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Now I''m here wonderin''... is that watch is still sittin'' there?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507237
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: That''s better.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507238
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Reminds me, though. Found these little glasses once. Kid''s specs, tiny.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507239
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Picked ''em up, saw fingerprints smudged on the lenses. Kept picturin'' that kid wearin'' ''em, seein'' the world...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507240
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Now he''s either strugglin'' without ''em, or he ain''t seein'' anything at all.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507241
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Mine? They itch...burn for a couple of days, I can take it. Not the first time. Not the last.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507242
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: I''ve suffered through it my entire life. And I''ll continue to suffer. Money''s always got a better use.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507243
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Oh man... Found an old photo once. Two kids, husband, wife. Smilin'' big.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507244
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Kept wonderin'' if any of ''em made it? Or is that picture all that''s left of that happy family?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507245
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: When you''re alone, you start hearin'' whispers. Ain''t nothin'' there, but still, you listen... just in case.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507246
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Should never have come here...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507247
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: Should never have trusted a bastard like you...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507248
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Tch... Fine, go on, check. I''m wide open. ...Turned inside-out long ago.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507249
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507250
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507251
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507252
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507253
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507254
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507255
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: When you dig too deep... sometimes you don''t just find bones.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507256
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507257
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: These white ones are mine. Fair ''n'' square! Those shiny ones...well...let''s just say I found ''em.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507258
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Would''ve been wasted down there anyway, but look, ta-da! They came in handy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507259
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507260
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507261
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: These hands fed me, kept me alive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507262
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507263
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Fingers like roots. Black nails that never come clean. Dirt stuck in ''em like memories...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507264
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507265
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507266
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Nights are my shift.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507267
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507268
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Daytime folk see the sun, but all I see is the lamp on my head and shadows in the grave.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507269
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Ever since that time, though, I''ve been jumpy. Eyes dartin''. Waitin'' for a Visitor to creep up. Hard way to live.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507270
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Daytime folk see the sun, but all I see is the lamp on my head and shadows in the grave.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507271
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: And maybe that''s for the best. Never saw the sun, never will...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507272
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507273
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507274
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Ugh, well, aren''t you something...?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507275
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507276
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: It itches, like the dirt''s crawlin'' under my skin. Besides, I got holes to dig and no time for shaving.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507277
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507278
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507279
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: A photo''s a dangerous thing, I tell ya! Like a mirror. It keeps what it sees.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507280
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507281
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Hah... Hmm, that''s a funny one. Looks like shadows... Probably just dust on the lens.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507282
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507283
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507284
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507285
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Just ears. Ain''t nothin'' fancy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507286
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507287
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Can''t be more normal than that. Not burned or fallin'' off. Still hear stuff... I wish they didn''t.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507288
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507289
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507290
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: If you''re gonna shoot, shoot. Just don''t take the gold, or I might have to come back for it later... OOOooOOoooO!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507291
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507292
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507293
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Maybe my time''s up... These hands''ve touched too many dead. Time to join ''em.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507294
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507295
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507296
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Maybe better not to see at all...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507297
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507298
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507299
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: If my pits scare you, better not look what''s inside my mind.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507300
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507301
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507302
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: You... You see somethin'' in that photo? Behind me... That''s just smoke. It''s smoke, right? Tell me it''s just smoke...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507303
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: So what is it? A ghost? Ash? A bag of meat, hanging from a hook?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507304
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507305
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507306
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: The earth whispers, y''know. Pspspsps...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507307
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Go on. Pull the trigger. Maybe it''ll shut up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507308
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507309
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507310
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: I used to think it was a sin. But then...the body''s just lyin'' there, mouth open, gold gleamin''...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507311
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Who''s gonna miss it? Dead don''t care. Livin'' need it more. Maybe the dead got mad about it, huh...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507312
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Sometimes you use a shovel. Sometimes bare hands when the ground''s frozen. Fingers bleed, but you keep diggin''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507313
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Cause you gotta. ''Cause you can''t stop. ''Cause if you do, you''ll hear the earth whisper. And you''ll never forget it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507314
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Sometimes you cover one up, then you hear a rustle in the dirt. You look, but there''s nothin''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507315
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Eyes burn from what they''ve seen, not lack of sleep. But the fear that I gotta keep watch ''case I see them again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507316
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Sometimes you cover one up, then you hear a rustle in the dirt. You look, but there''s nothin''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507317
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Eyes burn... not from lack of sleep, but from what they''ve seen. More than they should''ve.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507318
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: I remember one summer haulin'' a coffin. Sweatin'' and itchin''. One guy joked, "Feels like we''re buryin'' ourselves."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507319
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: And I thought... Dang, maybe we are. I bury myself in these dead, piece by piece.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507320
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Sometimes I think maybe it''s still down there... Where he was. I buried him myself, I remember... Eh. Forget it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507321
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: A photo''s like a flash between worlds. Shows the ones who didn''t leave. Who maybe weren''t meant to...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507322
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: They used to say photos steal your soul. Now I think...maybe they take only the warm part.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507323
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: I been stiff a long time. Even in the picture...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507324
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Sometimes I lie flat, ear to the ground. Since that time I...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507325
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: I hear somebody''s callin''...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507326
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Maybe it''s just my head. Or maybe...think about it...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507327
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Visitors might be hidin'' under there, crawlin'' out one by one...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507328
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: Well...let''s see if there''s somethin'' on the other side.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507329
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507330
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Well, go ahead... Just don''t waste precious time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507331
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507332
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507333
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507334
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507335
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507336
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507337
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: So, you actually take your job seriously.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507338
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507339
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Well...listen, I''ve seen better days.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507340
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: You know, we had this case once... Caught someone. Commander looked in his mouth, said he was a Visitor and then BANG!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507341
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: So I figured it''s better not to get too thorough with teeth. Just to avoid questions, if you know what I mean?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507342
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507343
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507344
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: You want me to take off my gloves? No way. Not safe. You''ll have to test me like this.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507345
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507346
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507347
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507348
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507349
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Ah, yes. I love this one. People''s eyes are beautiful after all.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507350
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507351
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Red? Yeah, you see, when you''re stuck in this mask all the time...it does things to you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507352
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Your vision gets worse. Everything narrows, like you''re looking always through eyeholes, even when you aren''t...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507353
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507354
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507355
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: You really want to see this?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507356
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507357
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Disgusting, right...?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507358
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: That''s what you get when you sweat in the suit. Skin cracks, even rots. Not the worst that''s happened to me, though.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507359
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507360
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507361
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: I need to warn you, it might look...unusual.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507362
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507363
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: They told me, the longer you work around Visitors, the stranger your aura gets.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507364
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507365
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507366
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: You kidding? We didn''t train for this! Don''t know about others, but our team never checked for this.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507367
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507368
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: It''s a normal ear. You''re wasting your time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507369
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507370
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507371
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Wait, wait, hold up. My teeth are fine, I know they are. What are you doing?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507372
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507373
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507374
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Look, you really want me to take off my gloves? Then I need time... No way I''m doing it right now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507375
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507376
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507377
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: These eyes have seen too much. Maybe...it''s finally time to close them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507378
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507379
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507380
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: I know this is freaky, but hear me out...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507381
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507382
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507383
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: I warned you. Try taking a photo of your aura first, see what you get. Then you can point the gun at me...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507384
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507385
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507386
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: You do realize you''re checking the wrong thing, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507387
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507388
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507389
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: I can''t forget that moment. We didn''t even check properly, just bang! And that person was gone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507390
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Might not''ve even been a Visitor. Now I don''t bother with teeth, just in case...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507391
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Days on end in that suit. Heat, sweat, hands smelling of rot...and you can''t take it off! It becomes a pattern.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507392
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: You take off your gloves, and...it''s like they aren''t even yours anymore.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507393
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: At first you''re just doing your job. Then suddenly, you realize you don''t see people anymore. You see silhouettes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507394
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Then smoke, then embers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507395
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Then...emptiness.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507396
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Sometimes you work and work and work. You want to believe the people above care for your safety. But it turns out...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507397
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Turns out nobody gives a damn. If you want to live well, you fight for it yourself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507398
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: And if you don''t fight, you get used to the suffering. It just becomes normal, and that''s how you live till the end...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507399
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: I wonder... Why do you do all this? Why let people in, spend energy checking them?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507400
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: What if you get attached to someone, and it turns out they''re a Visitor? That pain...killing someone you grew to like...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507401
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: You can''t trust everything you see. You need critical thinking. Learn to tell truth from lies.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507402
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Especially on TV. The news is totally owned by those...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507403
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: But then who can you trust? Why is this world so damn complicated?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507404
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: If someone could simplify it, people would make them a saint. Ha…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507405
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: Wait, you are making a mistake!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507406
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: I''M WITH FEMA!!!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507407
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Hmm. Let us see what''s changed overnight.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507408
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507409
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507410
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507411
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507412
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507413
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507414
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Yes. I''ll show you in a moment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507415
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I''m so tired, I tend to forget things.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507416
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507417
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I think we need to put less focus on the little things. Make all of this seem a little less...odd.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507418
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I may have a bad memory, but I still remember to brush my teeth.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507420
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Taking care of yourself is important. Makes all of this seem a little more...normal.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507421
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I wonder, can you tell a Visitor by their dreams?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507422
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507423
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507424
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: These hands are ready to push through any thing in my way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507425
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: In that way, maybe I''m clawing my way into my own dreams?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507426
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507427
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...What am I even fighting against?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507428
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I need to dream, don''t I...?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507429
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507430
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507431
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I heard somewhere that insomnia makes your eyes darker.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507432
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I wonder if that''s true?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507433
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507434
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Hmm. They used to be whiter. Now they''ve gotten really red.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507435
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: If you didn''t notice, I haven''t slept in...well, a long time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507436
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: So why aren''t my eyes red? Strange...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507437
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507438
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507439
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: For some reason they hurt, like they''re irritated. Odd...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507440
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507441
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: So? Not good?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507442
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507443
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507444
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I''m curious to see what it looks like.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507445
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507446
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Ah, so it''s not just a normal one. It has some sort of...aura?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507447
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: It looks kind of...empty.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507448
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Are you sure this thing even works?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507449
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I mean... Does an aura even exist? Have you seen one?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507450
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Dreams exist. At least, they used to. But an aura...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507451
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507452
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507453
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Hmm? Haven''t heard of that one before.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507454
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Why not, let''s give it a try.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507455
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507456
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: And... What''s the verdict?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507457
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...Do you even know what to look for?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507458
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507459
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507460
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: You know, I haven''t slept in so long that I can''t tell if any of this is actually happening...or if it''s all a dream.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507461
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...That would explain a lot.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507462
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507463
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507464
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Hmmm. Interesting. Say, if people still had dreams, could I break into someone else''s...?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507465
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507466
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507467
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I''m just looking around for a place to sleep.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507468
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I feel sluggish, but my eyes just keep getting more alert.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507469
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Wait...You don''t think I have Visitor signs, do you? The ones they talk about on the TV?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507470
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: What''s made you so suspicious, I wonder?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507471
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I don''t understand.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507472
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507473
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507474
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Hmm? Really?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507475
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: My skin''s drying out from the lack of sleep. Isn''t it the same for you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507476
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507477
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507478
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Before you shoot me, I have a...request...for you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507479
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507480
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507481
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Could you make sure to ruin my whole body?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507482
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: So that, even if I wake up, I can''t climb back in.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507483
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: And the flesh doesn''t reclaim me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507484
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Let me spend some time in the afterlife. Just for a while.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507485
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I''ll manage without my body. Somehow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507486
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507487
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507488
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Hmmm, wouldn''t it make more sense if Visitors had dirty teeth?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507489
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: If they crawl up from underground, they''d probably get some dirt in their mouth trying to get out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507490
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Why do you think my nails are dirty?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507491
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I''m just trying to claw into a dream any way I can.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507492
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: If I managed that, I''d stop hurting myself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507493
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...Pain would lose its meaning.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507494
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Hmmm... Why would the eyes darken?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507495
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Wouldn''t they dry out from all the constant strain? They should probably go glassy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507496
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Hmmm... Why aren''t my eyes red?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507497
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Wouldn''t they dry out from all the constant strain?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507498
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I haven''t slept in ages. Something doesn''t add up, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507499
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: So, nobody has this? Odd.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507500
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: When you don''t sleep for a long time, you start to feel a chill...and after a while. A dryness.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507501
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: And over time, there''s this fever that builds up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507502
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: And it just keeps getting worse.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507503
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Where did you hear about this sign, anyway?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507504
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Ah, from the TV? Odd...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507505
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: I... I just don''t know.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507506
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Sure, I can understand everything else. But an aura...?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507507
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: So many people have gone mad over supernatural stuff lately, it scares me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507508
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: We haven''t even figured out the natural yet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507509
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: It sounds like an interesting report. On the verge between sleep and reality.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507510
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Are you sure you actually saw it, though?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507511
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Maybe it was all a dream.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507512
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Though... I''d understand that. Strange...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507513
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: It''s kind of funny how you''ve decided to kill someone because of something you were told.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507514
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...More scary than funny, I guess.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507515
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Mad world... No dreams... Me dying...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507516
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: Or just falling asleep...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507517
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: Death shall warm us with Her cold embrace.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507518
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507519
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507520
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507521
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507522
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507523
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507524
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507525
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507526
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507527
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507528
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507529
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507530
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507531
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507532
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507533
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507534
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507535
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507536
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: I tire of preparations.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507537
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507538
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
