    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507567
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: There is no worth in that.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507568
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507569
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507570
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507571
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507572
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507573
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: Tell me... Why do you trouble yourself with these tests?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507574
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: Simply prepare to depart when the time arrives.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507575
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: I do not know what it is you wait for.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507576
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: I have nothing else to say.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507577
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507578
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507579
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: My image has not been immortalized for the longest time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507580
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507581
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: You will answer for your actions.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507582
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: You have made a grave mistake.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507583
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: There''s no need to be afraid. We will all depart to a better realm. We will find salvation.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507584
