    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507618
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507619
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507620
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507621
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507622
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: That is more...unnerving...than expected.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507623
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507624
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507625
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: It''s... It''s too soon...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507626
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507627
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507628
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: I... I am not yet ready to depart.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507629
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507630
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507631
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: Oh...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507632
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507633
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507634
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: Ah, the perils of trying something new.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507635
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507636
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507637
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ...It is not yet time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507638
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: Please don''t.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507639
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507640
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507641
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: Thank you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507642
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: They tell us all suffering will end after Her coming.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507643
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: I hope it is true... I''ve suffered enough. It is time to rest.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507644
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: They teach us that beyond this world lies eternal tranquility.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507645
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: Do you yet understand the terror of Death? To know your end approaches?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507646
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: This feels so...shameful. My armpits are merely the pits of my arms.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507647
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: And yet, even the word tastes strange in my mouth.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507648
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: Ah, not just a regular photograph I see.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507649
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: I do not understand it. But it''s...beautiful.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507650
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: Thank you, brother.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507651
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: So many methods to detect an Outsider...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507652
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ...And yet they still run amok.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507653
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: All is well... I am protected. I... I go now to a better life... A-All is well... There is nothing to fear...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507654
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ...Fuck! I-I don''t wanna d—!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507655
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: Do as you wish. But do not obstruct our path.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507656
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507657
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507658
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507659
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507660
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507661
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507662
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: Amusing how the lower and upper jaws can be so different.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507663
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507664
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507665
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507666
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507667
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: These make us look like the Outsiders.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507668
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507669
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: They will beckon Death. She will save us.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507670
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507671
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507672
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: These eyes of mine now hardly see.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507673
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507674
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: I may depart before my brothers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507675
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507676
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507677
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ...'
