    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315292
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: God forbid you show this to anyone in FEMA.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315293
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315294
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: You ever hear of vampires?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315295
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: They don''t show up in photos, only move at night, and...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315296
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ...They''re immortal.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315297
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315298
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315299
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Don''t you think these checks are kinda stupid?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315300
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315301
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Here''s a secret: wax in someone''s ears? Totally normal.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315302
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315303
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315304
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Got no smaller toothpicks, huh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315305
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Look, you wanna shoot? Go ahead.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315306
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: But I thought you knew how to listen.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315307
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315308
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315309
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Careful what you do with that thing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315310
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: I''m immortal, but you pull that trigger...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315311
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: You won''t get another word outta me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315312
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315313
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315314
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: You think I''m a Visitor, but you''re dead wrong.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315315
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: I''m immortal. You can''t kill me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315316
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315317
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315318
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Have you lost your mind?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315319
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Pull the trigger and you''ll learn nothing more about the Visitors.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315320
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315321
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315322
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Hope you loaded some silver in that thing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315323
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Otherwise, you''re just wasting bullets...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315324
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Along with the last of my patience.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315325
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315326
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315327
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Go on, pull the trigger if you trust that box of lies.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315328
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: But I won''t forget it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315329
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Mark my words—I''ll be back, and I''ll snap your neck.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315330
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315331
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315332
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: If my teeth bother you so much...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315333
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: I''ll be sure to give them a quick scrub next time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315334
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: With my finger.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315335
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: I know how this must looks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315336
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Out here, digging through shit like this...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315337
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Anyone would get their hands dirty.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315338
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Turn down that damn TV.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315339
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: It''s hard to stay clean these days.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315340
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: I''d look at your eyes if you hadn''t been struggling to sleep every night.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315341
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Crossing half the city...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315342
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Hiding from the sun in the day, dodging FEMA and Visitors at night...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315343
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: I''ve barely had a second to close my eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315344
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Armpits, huh? Real telling.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315345
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: FEMA''s completely lost it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315346
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: What next? Licking the Visitors'' ball sacks in search of new signs?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315347
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Let them come. They''re more than welcome to give mine a taste.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315348
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Best not point that gun at me again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315349
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Or it''ll end much worse for you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315350
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: But act respectful...?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315351
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: And your neck stays intact.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315352
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: I hope you''re just as pushy with those FEMA goons.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315353
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Unlike the Visitors, they don''t pretend to be human...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315354
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: They''re just assholes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315355
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Save your bullets.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315356
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: I guarantee you''ll burn through more rounds on those bastards than you would on the Visitors.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315357
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: I thought you were smarter than that...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315358
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Screw it...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315359
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: Always knew I''d die to someone else''s idiocy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315360
    m_Localized: Screw this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341556
    m_Localized: 'Nun: Now you look a fool and it doesn''t even bother you!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535899
    m_Localized: 'Blind: You can check me all you want. But...nothing will change. All of this is temporary.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535907
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535940
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924201
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: HAHAHA! You wouldn''t catch me spouting such NONSENSE!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507419
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58333830346432512
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58333830346432513
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58333830400958464
    m_Localized: Clean up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535808
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Alright. Lemme just finish this Enerjeka...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535809
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535810
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535811
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535812
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535813
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535814
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535815
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Did I tell you I can taste Enerjeka even when I’m not drinking it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535816
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Feels like it''s made of some mad chemicals.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535817
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: But who cares, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535818
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535819
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Oh, shit. My tongue’s stained.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535820
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Oh, shit. My teeth are ruined.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535821
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535822
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535823
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Um-kay, hands. Fine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535824
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: I kinda get itchy a lot, like ants running all over... Ha.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535825
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Don''t think I''ve been picking at anything, so my hands should be fine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535826
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535827
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Hmm, twisted them somehow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535828
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Heh, too much caffeine. Got the shakes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535829
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Lemme breathe for like ten minutes, maybe it’ll pass.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535830
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535831
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535832
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: I saw the report. The eyes should be a kinda dark, murky green.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535833
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Don’t mix it up though, there’s lots of types of green in the world these days.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535834
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535835
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Wait, what’s wrong?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535836
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: RED? THEY’RE SUPPOSED TO BE RED?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535837
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Then why were the ones on TV green? What do mine even look like?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535838
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Then why were the ones on TV green?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535839
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535840
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535841
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Ah, the only sign that makes sense.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535842
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535843
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: No particular color, no filth, none of that bullshit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535844
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Just. Regular. Armpits.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535845
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Nice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535846
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535847
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535848
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: I only ever got my pictures taken at parties.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535849
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: People don’t really throw parties anymore. Or maybe they just don’t invite me. Ha.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535850
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535851
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Yeah, my heart’s racing like crazy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535852
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: There''s not enough Enerjeka in the world to keep up with me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535853
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535854
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535855
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Fine, why not.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535856
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535857
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Should I’ve cleaned them first?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535858
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Or what?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535859
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535860
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535861
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Oh, wow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535862
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: I thought you weren’t one of those shoot-everything-that-moves guys. There’s already enough of those.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535863
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: I thought I’d get a break from violence here, honestly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535864
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535865
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535866
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: You picked a hell of a moment, huh.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535867
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: You’re not gonna shoot, are you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535868
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Unless cramps are a new sign these days?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535869
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535870
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535871
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: This ain’t right.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535872
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: You mentioned redness yourself. Or...are my eyes red?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535873
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Look, tell me straight, I’m lost here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535874
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535875
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535876
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Not cool.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535877
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535878
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535879
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Hold up, there''s not some kind of hole in my heart.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535880
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: It’s just beating like crazy. You get it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535881
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Wait, gimme a sec, I’m getting short of breath.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535882
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535883
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535884
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: At least tell me the rules first!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535885
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535886
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535887
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: I get it, safety, precautions, and all that.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535888
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: That’s a fast track to losing it, y''know. You’ll end up shooting everyone, just ‘cause someone seems off.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535889
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Maybe it’d be easier if you left too. Tried to find a little peace.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535890
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Somewhere far away from this place.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535891
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: You know what’s scary? When you can’t even raise your hands, you can''t even block a gun.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535892
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Dumb, sure, but who wouldn''t at least try to shield themselves from a bullet?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535893
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Wait... so everything’s not actually kinda greenish?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535894
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Then...what color are things?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535895
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: I didn’t even notice when it all just went green…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535896
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Wow, that''s really tripping me out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535897
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: You don’t make people feel safe by scaring them with a gun, y''know.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535898
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: The Visitors don''t stop killing because you threatened some folks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535899
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: You just end up becoming the scary one yourself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535900
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Is it worth it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535901
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: There’s no point in intimidating people.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535902
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: You’ll... Hahh... You''ll only turn everyone against you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535903
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Jesus, wait a sec… Ngh... My damn heart.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535904
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Anyway… Stop pointing that gun at.... at everyone. It... It won’t do a damn thing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535905
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: I’ll just leave and... Haaah... Haaah... stop freaking you out, okay?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535906
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: So?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535907
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: That’s it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535908
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Let’s roll. Maybe it’s not too late to rock this world!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535909
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535910
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535911
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535912
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535913
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535914
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535915
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Yeeeah… These teeth have soaked up way too much smoke.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535916
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Funny, huh…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535917
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535918
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: That’s all I’ve got left from my crew. Memories and stains.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535919
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535920
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535921
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Got that one tattoo.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535922
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535923
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Wild night. The artist got smashed, and I was wasted enough to grow a pair.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535924
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Wait…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535925
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Maybe it wasn’t a tattoo.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535926
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Can’t even remember anymore…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535927
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535928
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535929
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: We once thought it’d be cool to inject ink straight into our eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535930
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: Still get flashbacks from that wild ride.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535931
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535932
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: No, not my eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535933
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Some other guy went fully blind. But man, you should’ve seen his eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535934
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: I’d kill for eyes like that…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535935
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535936
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535937
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Be my guest.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535938
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535939
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Anything?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535940
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535941
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535942
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Hell, let’s take a photo together. Maybe I''ll sign it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535943
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535944
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Whoa.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535945
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Maybe take the cap off your camera first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535946
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535947
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535948
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: I used to stretch my ears. Then… I got bored with it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535949
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924416
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Now they’re just torn-up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924417
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Still kinda like the look, though.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924418
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924419
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924420
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Honestly? Don’t give a damn anymore.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924421
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924422
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924423
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Not much left to be afraid of.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924424
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924425
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924426
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Chill, man. No need to wave that thing around.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924427
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924428
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924429
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: I don’t wanna stink. That’s a reason to shoot me?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924430
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Impressed, huh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924431
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924432
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924433
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Oh, that’s the one without the cap, huh.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924434
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924435
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924436
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Guess my style’s not your thing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924437
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924438
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924439
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Maybe that fat, perfect riff’s still waiting for me somewhere.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924440
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Don’t really have an idea for it. Just a dull buzz in my head.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924441
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: But really, if you pulled the trigger, what would it change?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924442
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: I''m never gonna get on a stage anyway.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924443
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Would kill to tear up a festival right now. I''m really feeling it right now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924444
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Too bad you don’t have anything stronger than beer.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924445
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: I’m dying to get fucking wasted.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924446
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Don’t even know what to say, man.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924447
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Thanks for checking, I guess.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924448
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Why’s the pic so dark, though?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924449
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Even our old rehearsal spot looked brighter than this — and you’ve got light here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924450
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: You know, I’d never thought about adding church bells to any of our tracks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924451
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: You know, I kinda feel like adding some church bells to our tracks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924452
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Our tracks, I say... Like there’s anyone left to play them with.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924453
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: You know…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924454
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: This might just be my greatest performance.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924455
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: Maybe the boys’ll be waiting for me up there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924456
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ROCK THE FUCK OUT!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924457
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Alright, mate. Say the word and I’ll show you what you wanna see.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924458
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924459
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924460
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924461
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924462
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924463
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924464
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Teeth, huh? They’re yellow. Cavities, or somethin’ like that.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924465
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: The screws ain’t exactly handin’ out minty toothbrushes. Don’t freak about the bleeding gums.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924466
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924467
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: That ain’t a sign of anything, right, mate?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924468
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924469
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924470
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: No problem, mate. Take a look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924471
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924472
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: See? Normal. Well…except...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924473
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Got a little somethin'' on my hands. Don’t sweat it, it’s just a heat rash.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924474
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: These hands? Used ’em well back in the day… but I already did my time for that.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924475
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924476
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924477
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Wanna see if I got a conscience in there?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924478
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924479
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Alright, then take a look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924480
    m_Localized: 'Experienced:  …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924481
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: I thought dark glasses would help keep the sun out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924482
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Turns out they made it worse. Useless, really.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924483
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Turns out they''re useless.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924484
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924485
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924486
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Mate, look... I’ll show ya, but...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924487
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924488
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Back in the day, I got burned fuckin'' around drunk. So don’t freak out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924489
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924490
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: There. So? Not one of those freaks, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924491
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924492
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924493
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Mate, you tryin’ to book my ass? What’s with the mugshot? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924494
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ...Or is this some kinda test?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924495
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924496
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Feels like I’m back gettin’ logged. Photo goin’ in my file and all that.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924497
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Fine, snap it if you gotta.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924498
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924499
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: You done?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924500
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924501
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924502
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: What the fuck? Ears now?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924503
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: You''re losin'' it, mate.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924504
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: You really need to see those?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924505
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924506
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Fine, fuck it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924507
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924508
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: So? Found any loose screws in there?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924509
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924510
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924511
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Sure you ain’t lost your marbles?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924512
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Teeth are yellow, why even pull out your piece? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924513
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Or you gonna pin me on the gums bleedin’ and take me out for that?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924514
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924515
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924516
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Mate, why the hell you reachin’ for that piece? Put it away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924517
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924518
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924519
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: You think I’m lying to ya? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924520
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: I’m tellin’ ya, dark glasses ain’t gonna stop the sun. Try it yourself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924521
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924522
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924523
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: I get it, seein’ my armpits ain’t pretty… '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924524
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: But why all this? We were talkin’ fine before.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924525
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924526
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924527
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Mate, you mixin’ me up with some other fucker?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924528
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: I did my crime, served my time — got out not long ago.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924529
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924530
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924531
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: You serious, mate? This is way over the line.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924532
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Fine, teeth and dirt I get. But ears? Nobody ever mentioned ears.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924533
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924534
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924535
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Good. Don’t go pullin'' a piece at every little twitch.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924536
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: A single itchy trigger finger, and that''s it. It''s all over.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924537
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: I knew you were a no-nonsense kinda guy, but ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924538
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: But don’t put a gun to the head of every little thing, got it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924539
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Had enough of that from the screws, trust me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924540
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: This is your crib, so I''m sayin’ nothin’. But don’t run it like some tyrant.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924541
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: You ain’t the top dog from the block, pickin’ bones clean, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924542
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Better save your blueys, I mean, your rounds, mate.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924543
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Trust me, I’m the real deal. Cross my heart!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924544
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: It''s the one thing I own that I didn''t steal.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924545
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: You outta your mind, mate? You tryin’ to kill me over a stupid photo?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924546
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Even the damn screws didn’t ride me this hard, man…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924547
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Well, look at that, you came to your damn senses.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924548
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: For a second there, I thought you’d really pop me over some crap the damn TV never even mentioned.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924549
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: Shit, you are such a dumb son of a bitch. I thought you were solid. But you''re a bad apple!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924550
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: And your barrel will spoil!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924551
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Oh man… If I really am a Visitor, don’t tell me. Just shoot. Alright?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924552
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924553
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924554
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924555
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924556
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924557
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924558
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Yeah, take a look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924559
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924560
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: I’ve got a bad overbite. Sometimes I end up chewing on my own cheeks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924561
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Then I get sores… Those are not fun.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924562
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924563
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924564
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: No problem.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924565
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924566
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Well, the jacket’s made of cheap crap. It gives me the rash, that''s all.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924567
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: See? Nothing out of ordinary.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924568
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924569
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924570
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: I’ll show you my eyes, just…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924571
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Honestly, I’m a little nervous. Don’t judge too much.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924572
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924573
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Well? Everything fine?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924574
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924575
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924576
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Oh, about the armpits…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924577
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924578
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: I know irritation’s a sign of a Visitor.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924579
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: But it’s from the jacket — I sweat in it, and there’s nowhere to shower these days.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924580
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924581
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924582
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: I don’t mind taking a photo, but your camera looks kinda weird.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924583
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924584
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Whoa, is that one of those aura films from the ads?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924585
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Honestly, you don’t seem like the kinda person who’d believe in all that stuff.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924586
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924587
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924588
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924589
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Ears weren’t on the list of signs, were they?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924590
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Though I’ll admit, I am not particularly aware what the signs are. Maybe I just missed that one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924591
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924592
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: So? Everything ok?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924593
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924594
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924595
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: I’m a Visitor?! But my teeth are crooked!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924596
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: DON’T SHOOT, PLEASE!!!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924597
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924598
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924599
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Wait, I told you — the rash is from the jacket!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924600
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Wait, there’s nothing on my hands!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924601
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: I’M NOT A VISITOR!!! DON’T SHOOT ME, PLEASE!!!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924602
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924603
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924604
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: What?! I’m a Visitor?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924605
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: But my eyes aren’t even red!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924606
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924607
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924608
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Shit… Am I really a Visitor?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924609
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: SHIT, SHIT, SHIT!!!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924610
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924611
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924612
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Wait, wait! What’s wrong?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924613
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Did the aura thing show something?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924614
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924615
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924616
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Wait, what’s wrong with my ears?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924617
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: What''s the issue?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924618
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924619
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924620
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Thanks…for not shooting me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924621
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: My whole life just flashed before my eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924622
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: You did that on purpose, didn’t you?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924623
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: My heart just lept into my mouth. Why would you do something like that?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924624
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: What was the sign?! Why’d you even....'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924625
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Wait…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924626
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: A twitching pupil’s a sign of a Visitor?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924627
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924628
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Honestly, I didn’t even know about that one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924629
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: You changed your mind about killing me?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924630
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924631
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Thanks for not pulling the trigger, but…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924632
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: If you’re still unsure who I am, maybe don’t grab the gun and scare the hell outta me next time?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924633
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: You thought the pattern on my jacket was a Visitor sign?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924634
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Phew… I was worried there’d be a lot of dark spots.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924635
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Weird thing, that aura cam…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924636
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: So I’m not a VIsitor?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924637
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924638
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Then why’d you pull the gun? WHY THE HELL?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924639
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: Mom, Dad… I’m sorry.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924640
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: I’m so sorry…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414656
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I won''t be pushed around.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414657
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414658
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414659
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414660
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414661
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414662
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414663
    m_Localized: 'Tough: My canines stick out, they''ve been that way since I was a kid.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414664
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I got teased for it a lot. Not anymore.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414665
    m_Localized: 'Tough: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414666
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I could rip the teeth out of their smirking mouths.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414667
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414668
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414669
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I like feeling pretty.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414670
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Nobody ever says it to me, but it’s nice to feel that way for myself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414671
    m_Localized: 'Tough: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414672
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Oh, for fuck sake.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414673
    m_Localized: 'Tough: They’re chipped? How the hell did that happen?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414674
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Whatever…screw it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414675
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414676
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414677
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I''ve seen a lot of shit in my life.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414678
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I''m sure it''s all right there, if you care to look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414679
    m_Localized: 'Tough: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414680
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Just like I thought.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414681
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414682
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414683
    m_Localized: 'Tough: No. That’s not what we''re gonna do.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414684
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Are you one of those freaks obsessed with that particular sign?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414685
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I don’t wanna kill someone again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414686
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I don’t wanna be disappointed again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414687
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414688
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414689
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I don’t take pictures often. But sure, let’s see what comes out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414690
    m_Localized: 'Tough: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414691
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Can’t say I buy into all that “aura” crap, but…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414692
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Somehow, it kinda makes sense.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414693
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414694
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414695
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Just got my ears pierced, actually.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414696
    m_Localized: 'Tough: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414697
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I like it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414698
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Used to wear small earrings, but could never find the right pair.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414699
    m_Localized: 'Tough: These, though…I''m feeling it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414700
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414701
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414702
    m_Localized: 'Tough: You’re pointing at the wrong threat.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414703
    m_Localized: 'Tough: The monster in this house sure as hell isn’t me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414704
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414705
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414706
    m_Localized: 'Tough: What, you want me to take my acrylics off? It''s not gonna happen.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414707
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414708
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414709
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I have to keep an eye on everything.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414710
    m_Localized: 'Tough: And I mean everything.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414711
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Nothing to be done about it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414712
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Wish I could forget half the things I’ve seen.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414713
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Or all of it, really.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414714
    m_Localized: 'Tough: But that’s not how it works.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414715
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414716
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414717
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Fuck damn...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414718
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414719
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414720
    m_Localized: 'Tough: But not to you, huh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414721
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414722
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414723
    m_Localized: 'Tough: What the hell did you even see there? Earwax?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414724
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Why the fuck are you pulling a gun on me?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414725
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414726
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414727
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Is this some kind of test? Well? Did I pass? Didn’t flinch, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414728
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Still, doesn’t feel great, having a gun at your face.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414729
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Sure, looks don’t mean much anymore.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414730
    m_Localized: 'Tough: But it still feels good to…look decent. To like what you see in the mirror.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414731
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I hate seeing what’s happening out there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414732
    m_Localized: 'Tough: But that’s not changing any time soon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414733
    m_Localized: 'Tough: All we can do is keep fighting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414734
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Tell me, do you really think it’s worth it? Would you shoot me if you felt like it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414735
    m_Localized: 'Tough: And after you did, would you even look at my body?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414736
    m_Localized: 'Tough: This world’s cursed as hell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414737
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Tell me, do you believe in auras? Souls? Any of that?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414738
    m_Localized: 'Tough: You think a scumbag stays a scumbag even after death?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414739
    m_Localized: 'Tough: I keep thinking... When this ends, what''ll happen to all the pushovers?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414740
    m_Localized: 'Tough: What’ll it be like for them?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414741
    m_Localized: 'Tough: You really gonna pull that trigger?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414742
    m_Localized: 'Tough: And that’ll be it... My whole fight…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414743
    m_Localized: 'Tough: Ended in the house of some lonely freak.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414744
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Yeah, no problem, friend. What do you wanna see?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414745
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414746
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414747
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414748
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414749
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414750
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414751
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Uh…sure. I smoke sometimes. Hope I don’t stink too much.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414752
    m_Localized: 'Bald: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414753
    m_Localized: 'Bald: So? All hunky-dory?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414754
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414755
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414756
    m_Localized: 'Bald: I''ve, uh…got eczema. That’s why there’s a bandage on my arm.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414757
    m_Localized: 'Bald: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414758
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Heard somewhere that covering up can help with that kind of stuff.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414759
    m_Localized: 'Bald: It’s mostly healed. Still, I’d like to change the patch just in case. You don’t happen to have a spare one, do you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414760
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414761
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414762
    m_Localized: 'Bald: You probably noticed, I’ve got this crappy thing on my eye.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414763
    m_Localized: 'Bald: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414764
    m_Localized: 'Bald: No idea when it popped up. Scared the bajeezus outta me, though.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414765
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414766
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414767
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Don’t freak out, alright?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414768
    m_Localized: 'Bald: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414769
    m_Localized: 'Bald: It’s just another skin thing. See? I’m bald, and I’ve got patches like that all over.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414770
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Shit, I haven’t showered in forever. My bad.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414771
    m_Localized: 'Bald: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414772
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Armpits are just…armpits.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414773
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414774
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414775
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Oh, I love that. Roll camera!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414776
    m_Localized: 'Bald: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414777
    m_Localized: 'Bald: So? Lemme see!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414778
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414779
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414780
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Yeah, sure thing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414781
    m_Localized: 'Bald: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414782
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Honestly, I hate cleaning them. Poke too deep, and it hurts like hell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414783
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414784
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414785
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Hey, c’mon, what’s all that about? We were good a second ago…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414786
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414787
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414788
    m_Localized: 'Bald: O-Okay, okay! No need to point that thing at me!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414789
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Forget the bandage, I’m good. I''m good!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414790
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414791
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414792
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Come on! It’s fine! It''s not like I''m dying or anything.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414793
    m_Localized: 'Bald: No point seeing a doctor, anyway. You know what they say: “Bullshit heals, real shit doesn’t.”'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414794
    m_Localized: 'Bald: And this? This is bullshit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414795
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414796
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414797
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Oh, relax, will you? Everything’s fine! Don’t wave that gun at me!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414798
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414799
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414800
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Shit, man! We can do a retake if it''s that bad!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414801
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Or maybe your cam’s busted, huh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414802
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414803
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414804
    m_Localized: 'Bald: But I didn’t do anything!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414805
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414806
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414807
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Couldn’t afford a dentist, that’s all.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414808
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Although…we couldn’t afford much of anything besides food.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414809
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Ma would whip me up some clothes from leftover fabric scraps every now and then.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414810
    m_Localized: 'Bald: One time I got completely wasted with my theater buddies.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414811
    m_Localized: 'Bald: It was sooo fucked up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414812
    m_Localized: 'Bald: I couldn''t even recognize my own hands. Felt like I was watching a movie in first person.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414813
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Lucky I didn’t do anything stupid. Walked home in mismatched shoes but made it somehow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414814
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Scared the hell outta me, though. Quit drinking after that. Could’ve ended up dead if I''d kept it up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414815
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Still, I was scared shitless at first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414816
    m_Localized: 'Bald: I started freaking myself out, thinking I was losing my eyesight or something.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414817
    m_Localized: 'Bald: But no. It’s been like that for years.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414818
    m_Localized: 'Bald: And getting treatment? That’d cost a fortune I don’t have.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414819
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Well, what can I say.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414820
    m_Localized: 'Bald: You’re dangerous, friend. You get to decide who lives and who dies.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414821
    m_Localized: 'Bald: That’s fucked up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414822
    m_Localized: 'Bald: We were drinking again, just like always.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414823
    m_Localized: 'Bald: A few days later, we found out one of our friends never made it home.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414824
    m_Localized: 'Bald: We printed out her pictures, put up flyers everywhere.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414825
    m_Localized: 'Bald: And you know what?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414826
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Turns out she slipped, fell into the river and drowned.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414827
    m_Localized: 'Bald: That’s fucked up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414828
    m_Localized: 'Bald: She was a nice girl. Pretty, too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414829
    m_Localized: 'Bald: I used to love when Ma cleaned my ears. She did it so gently, never once hurt me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414830
    m_Localized: 'Bald: But she won''t do it again...not anymore… Not with her fingers like that...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414831
    m_Localized: 'Bald: Shit…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414832
    m_Localized: 'Bald: You fucker!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414833
    m_Localized: 'Bald: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414834
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Reminds of the ward a little, teehee...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414835
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414836
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414837
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414838
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414839
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414840
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414841
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Those meds made my teeth a little thinny-winny...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414842
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414843
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: These needle nippers are good for tearing at my cheeks. Pulling little strips of skin, layer by layer.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414844
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Until I feel the blood. And the pain. Oh the pain...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414845
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414846
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414847
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: I''ve learned to stop picking at my nails.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414848
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414849
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: But when the skin sticks out, I just want to pull it off.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414850
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Peeling the flesh slowly, so I can feel the burn. Teehee...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414851
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: It stings for a while. So I dig around in the ground while it''s raw... Mmmm... Hard, sharp, rough…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414852
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: It stings for a while.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414853
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414854
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414855
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: I like your eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414856
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414857
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: I watch you when you sleep. When you wander at night...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414858
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Don’t trust someone? Teehee...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414859
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414860
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414861
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: They never taught me how to take care of myself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414862
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: But I saw how they did a little wishy-washy in the hospital.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414863
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414864
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: I never got it right, teehee.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414865
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Now I can do it too, teehee.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414866
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414867
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414868
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: I don''t like that.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414869
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Hm.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414870
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414871
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: They used to laugh at me... Now they''ll never laugh again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414872
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414873
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414874
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: I don''t give them any attention.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414875
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414876
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Pointless.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414877
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: No pleasure, no pain. No point.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414878
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414879
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414880
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Rough bristles scraping across gums... Oh, god yes...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414881
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: But this...this is too much...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414882
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414883
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414884
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: WHY?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414885
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414886
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414887
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ME?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414888
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: I didn’t kill you in your sleep...yet!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414889
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: How could you? Not little old me... Teehee...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414890
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414891
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414892
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Oh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414893
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: My smooth pits make me evil?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414894
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: And yet... Teehee...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414895
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414896
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414897
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: So...nice...of you, teehee.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414898
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414899
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414900
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Why did you get all shooty-wooty with me?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414901
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Are you any better? Cleaner?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414902
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414903
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414904
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: They fried my brain in that hospital. Zap zap zap!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414905
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: But the only one who could help me…was me. Teehee.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414906
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: I stopped picking my fingers when I started chewing my cheeks!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414907
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Teehee.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414908
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Pointing a little gunny-wunny at someone who knows where and when you sleep...? Teehee...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414909
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Do Visitors really differ from those who just don''t fit in?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414910
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Society hates both...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414911
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: How can you tell? Can you tell? Can you? Teehee...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414912
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: A shadow looming over me... Teehee...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414913
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: What could it be? Is someone there? Or is it some weird glare?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414914
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: What are those stripey-wipeys?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414915
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Is it...NEEDLES?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414916
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Or just a light leak?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414917
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Why did you point a gun at me?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414918
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Did somebody tell you to do it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414919
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Well? Did they? Did they?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414920
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: No? ...Just a thought.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414921
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Teehee...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414922
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: Maybe I shouldn''t have...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414923
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ...come here...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414924
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Go on then, if it makes you feel better.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414925
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414926
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414927
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414928
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414929
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414930
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414931
    m_Localized: 'Leper: See? Normal.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414932
    m_Localized: 'Leper: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414933
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Straight, too. Maybe my skin’s a mess, but my chompers are perfect.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414934
    m_Localized: 'Leper: You’re not gonna kill me over the one good thing I have going, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414935
    m_Localized: 'Leper: They’re crooked, yeah. No reason to think I’m a Visitor.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414936
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414937
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414938
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Yeah, my skins bad there too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414939
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414940
    m_Localized: 'Leper: You’re not gonna call that a Visitor sign, are you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414941
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414942
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414943
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Alright, take a look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414944
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414945
    m_Localized: 'Leper: I know that red eyes are a sign. But this? It’s just the same damn skin condition as everything else.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414946
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Forgot to tell you, sometimes my eye twitches. It’s all from the same damn thing I was born with.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414947
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414948
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414949
    m_Localized: 'Leper: What? What''s that for?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414950
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414951
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Fine, whatever.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414952
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414953
    m_Localized: 'Leper: See? Nothing weird. Oddly enough, I don''t have any skin issues there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414954
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Yeah, it’s messed up there too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414955
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414956
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414957
    m_Localized: 'Leper: A photo? That’s a sign?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414958
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414959
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Fine, take the picture.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414960
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414961
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Guess I blinked. So what’s this sign supposed to be, huh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414962
    m_Localized: 'Leper: So what’s this sign supposed to be, huh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414963
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414964
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414965
    m_Localized: 'Leper: What? What the hell do you mean, ears?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414966
    m_Localized: 'Leper: No offense, but I know the Visitor signs and that’s not one of them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414967
    m_Localized: 'Leper: But if you really wanna see my ears, go ahead.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414968
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414969
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Well? See anything strange?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414970
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414971
    m_Localized: Pull out a gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414972
    m_Localized: 'Leper: What the hell’s wrong with you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414973
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414974
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414975
    m_Localized: 'Leper: I told you, it’s just my skin.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414976
    m_Localized: 'Leper: That’s all it is, a damn skin condition.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414977
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414978
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414979
    m_Localized: 'Leper: I''ve already said it’s from the disease!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414980
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414981
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414982
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Are you kidding me?! For what?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414983
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414984
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414985
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Wait, hold on. That’s not even a regular camera.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414986
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Is that…an aura photo? You gonna kill me over some bullshit spirit reading now?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414987
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414988
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414989
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Are you serious right now?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414990
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Ears aren’t even a Visitor sign! They never said that on TV!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414991
    m_Localized: Shoot them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414992
    m_Localized: Hear them out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414993
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Fuck...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414994
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Why the hell you point a gun at me?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414995
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Thanks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414996
    m_Localized: 'Leper: For a second there, I really thought you were gonna shoot me over how I look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414997
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Fuck.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414998
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Do you pull that gun every time you think you’ve found a sign?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414999
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415000
    m_Localized: 'Leper: You’re no better than the ones who think I’m contagious.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415001
    m_Localized: 'Leper: You okay in the head?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415002
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Since when does some quack camera tell you who’s a Visitor?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415003
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Goddammit…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415004
    m_Localized: 'Leper: You’re gonna give me a damn heart attack. Where’d you even hear about the ears thing?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415005
    m_Localized: 'Leper: FEMA never said that was a sign!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415006
    m_Localized: 'Leper: Shit, I don’t wanna…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415007
    m_Localized: 'Leper: …die…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621056
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: No problem! What exactly do you need to check?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621057
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621058
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621059
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621060
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621061
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621062
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621063
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621064
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621065
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: My teeth were never great, and I haven''t had the chance to see a dentist since graduation. Summer''s been…busy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621066
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621067
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621068
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621069
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621070
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Got these when I was a child. We used to explore abandoned places and there was some wire mesh on the floor...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621071
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: A friend of mine slipped off a cabinet and it crashed right onto my hands. Left this pattern...for life, I guess.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621072
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Ah, the scratches are new, though. I simply…got nervous.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621073
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621074
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621075
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621076
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621077
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: My eyes often get red from the heat. Cold compresses helped a lot, but that''s hard to come by now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621078
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: People have said all sorts of things about my eye color. Some nice, some…not so much.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621079
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621080
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621081
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Um… If you insist.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621082
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621083
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621084
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: I know. Please excuse the odor.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621085
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621086
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621087
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Sounds interesting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621088
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621089
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Huh. Interesting outcome.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621090
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621091
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621092
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621093
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621094
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Yes, I know. A little dirty. I haven''t really much time for self care lately.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621095
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621096
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621097
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: I''ll rinse my mouth! My apologies! I-I didn''t bring a toothbrush. Please, just don''t shoot me!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621098
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621099
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621100
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: My nails?! It happened just the other day! I caught them on some loose metal in the dark!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621101
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: It''s just a scar from childhood! My hands are fine otherwise! I promise!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621102
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621103
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621104
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Could I just grab something cold from the fridge? I''ve had this my whole life, I-I''ll show you! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621105
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Okay, okay! No more jokes! Please, don''t kill me! Please!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621106
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621107
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621108
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: My apologies. I didn''t bring any toiletries, and it felt like poor manners to use someone else''s.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621109
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621110
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621111
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: I hope you won''t judge me over something so minor? It''s nothing serious.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621112
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009664
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009665
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: I-I''ll clean them! Please don''t shoot!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009666
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009667
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009668
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Thank you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009669
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: I''ll try to take better care of my teeth.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009670
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Whew… I thought for a moment you were going to shoot me over that scar.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009671
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: It''s hard to take good care of one''s nails these days.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009672
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: But I''ll try to clean them more often, just in case.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009673
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Thank you for understanding.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009674
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: I''m not too thrilled about this condition myself either.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009675
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ...By the way, your eye color is beautiful.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009676
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Thank you for not shooting me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009677
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: I''ll try to make time to wash up properly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009678
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: I was thinking it would be quite ill-mannered to kill someone over a photo.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009679
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: It was an interesting experience…but I''d rather not die over it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009680
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Thank you for sparing me. I''ll clean them as soon as I can.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009681
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: I''ll try to find a cotton swab.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009682
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009683
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: Mommy…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009684
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Go ahead. Not like I''ve got anything better to do!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009685
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009686
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009687
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009688
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009689
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009690
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009691
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Aw, come on. Brush too hard and you''ll wear down the enamel.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009692
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009693
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Haha, forgot I was missing a tooth. Got a funny story behind that one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009694
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009695
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009696
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Just your regular work-worn hands.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009697
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009698
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Fourteen years at the factory.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009699
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: And for what, huh? Look how it all turned out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009700
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009701
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009702
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Got a dark spot on my iris.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009703
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Take a look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009704
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009705
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: There''s always a small spot in my vision, ''cause of it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009706
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: But live with it long enough, you stop noticing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009707
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009708
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009709
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Our plant''s a real lawsuit waiting to happen.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009710
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: I was supposed to retire soon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009711
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009712
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Now I''ve got this thing from the damp, see? Ointments are useless! And they still have the nerve to make us shave!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009713
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Now I''ve got this thing from the damp, see? Ointments are useless!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009714
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009715
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009716
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Oh, guess I should button up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009717
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Eh, screw it. It''s just one picture.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009718
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009719
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Don''t even show me. To hell with it, I don''t wanna look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009720
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Fine, lemme see what you got.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009721
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009722
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009723
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Go ahead, why not.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009724
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009725
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Well, there wasn''t anything at the plant that could damage our ears.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009726
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009727
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009728
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Whoa, easy there. No need to let that temper get the better of you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009729
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009730
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009731
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Why you getting all worked up? Chill already.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009732
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009733
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009734
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Ah, screw this.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009735
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: You wanna shoot, then shoot.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009736
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009737
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009738
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Ha! Yeah, that''ll fix everything, sure.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009739
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Cures any problem instantly!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009740
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009741
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009742
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Aha, the clearest sign of all! Big gun!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009743
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009744
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009745
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: You ever get tired of waving that thing around?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009746
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009747
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009748
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Well, thanks for not shooting me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009749
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: The story about the teeth? Nah, man. You really think you can just pull a gun and then chat like nothing happened?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009750
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Could you ever imagine going into work one day, and then they just lay you off?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009751
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Worked my ass off, and for what.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009752
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: They''re shutting the whole plant down because of growing losses. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009753
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Can''t even die in peace anymore.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009754
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: What else you wanna hear, huh?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009755
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: I can see you just fine. As well as that gun you had just pointed at me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009756
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: God''ll be your judge.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009757
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Guess I''m retired now, huh.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009758
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: No job, banks stole my money, sun''s burning everything else.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009759
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: What a life, huh? A real fairy tale! HAHAHA!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009760
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: My family always had this...nasty reaction to photos, for some reason.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009761
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: They''d be like, "Why''d you bring a camera in here? Go take pictures of frogs or something."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009762
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Guess I picked that up from them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009763
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Still, it''s unfair how they took my money.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009764
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Unfair how they kicked us out of the plant, too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009765
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Oh, you''re a funny one, aren''t you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009766
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: Well, at least this is it for me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009767
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: My final retirement.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009768
    m_Localized: 'Alt: If they could barely put those info reports together, I can only imagine how sloppy their screenings were.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009769
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009770
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009771
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009772
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009773
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009774
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009775
    m_Localized: 'Alt: I''m warning you, I''m a real business shark.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009776
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Hahaha.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009777
    m_Localized: 'Alt: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009778
    m_Localized: 'Alt: How could I not take care of such beauty?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009779
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Just had them filed down, actually. Gums still hurt. But makes me look like a maniac!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009780
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009781
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009782
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Got dealt a bad hand with the nails.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009783
    m_Localized: 'Alt: I called a cab to get to the outskirts in peace.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009784
    m_Localized: 'Alt: But…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009785
    m_Localized: 'Alt: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009786
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Some arrogant jerk shoved me aside, smiled, and got in.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009787
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Huh, I can still remember it clearly. His perfect white teeth.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009788
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009789
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009790
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Oh, my eyes? I like them almost as much as my tattoos.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009791
    m_Localized: 'Alt: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009792
    m_Localized: 'Alt: What do you think?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009793
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009794
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009795
    m_Localized: 'Alt: I don''t mind showing my armpits.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009796
    m_Localized: 'Alt: It''s just…not a nice sight.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009797
    m_Localized: 'Alt: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009798
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Told you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009799
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009800
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009801
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Oh wow, you''ve got a camera too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009802
    m_Localized: 'Alt: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009803
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Let''s see then…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009804
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009805
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009806
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Hm. Alright.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009807
    m_Localized: 'Alt: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009808
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Had to take the tunnels out. Too many drunks kept bothering me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009809
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009810
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009811
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Wait a sec. Doesn''t it bother you how vague those “signs” are?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009812
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Ordinary people can have them too. Doesn''t that pattern seem…suspiciously broad to you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009813
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009814
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009815
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Are you projecting that story I told you onto me?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009816
    m_Localized: 'Alt: What exactly do you think I did? It''s not my fault I fell and tore off a nail.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009817
    m_Localized: 'Alt: What exactly do you think I did?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009818
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009819
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009820
    m_Localized: 'Alt: What? Why?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009821
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009822
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009823
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Don''t freak out, I was fading a tattoo, and the heat made something weird happen.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009824
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Try removing ink in this heat yourself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009825
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Hurts like hell, and your whole body''s sweating nonstop.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009826
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009827
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009828
    m_Localized: 'Alt: I know, it''s odd.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009829
    m_Localized: 'Alt: I just wanted to look striking.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009830
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Definitely wasn''t planning on taking my obituary picture.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009831
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009832
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009833
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Now I kinda wish I hadn''t taken them out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009834
    m_Localized: 'Alt: At least then it''d be clear what I''m getting killed for.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009835
    m_Localized: Shoot her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009836
    m_Localized: Hear her out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009837
    m_Localized: 'Alt: I''m gonna take a little break from all the action, okay?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009838
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Kinda nerve-wracking, getting death threats.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009839
    m_Localized: 'Alt: I''m not going back to the city over some nails. No way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009840
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Who knows what happens the moment I step back into that mess.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009841
    m_Localized: 'Alt: I got most of my tattoos after someone close to me died.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009842
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Like memories preserved in ink.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009843
    m_Localized: 'Alt: As you can see, life hasn''t been easy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009844
    m_Localized: 'Alt: But when I lost my soulmate...that''s when I inked my eyes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009845
    m_Localized: 'Alt: So I''d still see him, every time I look in the mirror.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009846
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Best not to get tattoos in the wrong places, really.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009847
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Shame no one''ll mourn me. No one''ll preserve my memory when I''m gone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009848
    m_Localized: 'Alt: What strange times we live in…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009849
    m_Localized: 'Alt: Left one damn circus just to have the clowns follow me here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009850
    m_Localized: 'Alt: It''s scary.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009851
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: You think I''m infected?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009852
    m_Localized: Teeth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009853
    m_Localized: Hands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009854
    m_Localized: Eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009855
    m_Localized: Armpits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009856
    m_Localized: Photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009857
    m_Localized: Ears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009858
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: You mean…teeth can show if I caught the virus?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009859
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009860
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Well, if it helps…'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009861
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009862
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Straight, huh? Dentists back home don''t charge much.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009863
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009864
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009865
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: My hands? You''re looking for some kind of rash?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009866
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009867
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Don''t be alarmed, my skin itches after tanning. I might have scratched it a bit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009868
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: They''re a little sunburned, that''s all. But it''s not an infection.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009869
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009870
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009871
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: My eyes? No problem.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009872
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009873
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Sadly, sunglasses didn''t help much against this sun.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009874
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Good thing I brought my sunglasses.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009875
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009876
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009877
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: What?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009878
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009879
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009880
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Honestly, it''s just the heat. I''ve been sweating like crazy, and it gave me a rash.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009881
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009882
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009883
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Is that some kind of government tech to detect infections?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009884
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: If that''s what this is, I''m happy to try it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009885
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009886
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Huh… This film is...weird.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009887
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: And those dots…are weird as well.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009888
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009889
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009890
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Oh, that makes sense. What if the virus spreads through the ear canal?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009891
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009892
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: I think everything''s fine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009893
    m_Localized: Leave alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009894
    m_Localized: Pull out the gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009895
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: What is it? What''s wrong?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009896
    m_Localized: Shoot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009897
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009898
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: For God''s sake, I told you — I scratched them! It''s irritation!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009899
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Since when is getting a tan a symptom?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009900
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009901
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Why''re you pointing that thing at me? Because my eyes are red?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009902
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Why''re you pointing that gun at me?!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009903
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: My eyes are perfectly fine!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009904
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009905
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009906
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Are you saying rashes are a symptom?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009907
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009908
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009909
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: What for? I just said the film looked weird! Never seen one like that!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009910
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009911
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009912
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Wait, what''s the problem? I don''t even have any earwax!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009913
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009914
    m_Localized: Hear him out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009915
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009916
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Why''d you point a gun at me?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009917
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Can you put it down already?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009918
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: I get it, but that''s going too far.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009919
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: God, it''s just a tan!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009920
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009921
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Do you treat everyone in your house like this?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009922
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: So? You''re not gonna shoot?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009923
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: What the hell?! Armpits? That''s a symptom now?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009924
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Calm down!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009925
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Why do you grab your gun every damn time?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009926
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: You''re the one who wanted to take that picture in the first place!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009927
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: …'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009928
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Are you insane? That''s not a toy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009929
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Stop waving that gun around or you''ll scare everyone off!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009930
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: Damn... I never did... '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009931
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ...see the world...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94177391876841472
    m_Localized: Shoot him
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
